 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"Webcam Monitoring by PKP\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"FIF_PV_CLOUD\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"BOP-WAREHOUSE\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"wa-non_official-fif-tele\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"Multicam Premis\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"mtf\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"FIF_SKIPTRACE\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"Multicampaign\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"ADIRA\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"icoll\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"NASREC-SIM\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"wa-astrapay\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"btpn-scheduller\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"teleremedial-wa-official\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"Service Warehouse\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"FIF-reminder-autodial\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"MUF-TS\", idx: idx = idx + 1</span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; dict.Add \"WA-OFFICIAL-FIFDC\", idx: idx = idx + 1<span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; \' =================================================</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; keepMounts = Array(\"/\", \"/BACKUP\", \"/BACKUP3\", \"/etc/hostname\")</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; lastRow = ws.Cells(ws.Rows.Count, \"A\").End(xlUp).Row</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Application.ScreenUpdating = False</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; \' 1. Matikan filter terlebih dahulu agar sorting membaca semua baris data</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; If ws.AutoFilterMode Then ws.AutoFilterMode = False</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ws.Rows.Hidden = False</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; \' 2. Buat index angka urutan sementara di Kolom H (Kolom ke-8)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ws.Cells(1, 8).Value = \"SortIndex\"</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; For i = 2 To lastRow</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; serverName = Trim(ws.Cells(i, 1).Value)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; If dict.Exists(serverName) Then</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ws.Cells(i, 8).Value = dict(serverName)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Else</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ws.Cells(i, 8).Value = 999 \' Jika server tidak terdaftar di script, taruh di paling bawah</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; End If</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Next i</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; \' Set range data baru (A sampai H)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Set rng = ws.Range(\"A1:H\" &amp; lastRow)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; \' 3. Jalankan Sorting berdasarkan angka di Kolom H</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; With ws.Sort</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .SortFields.Clear</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .SortFields.Add2 Key:=ws.Range(\"H2:H\" &amp; lastRow), _</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;SortOn:=xlSortOnValues, _</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Order:=xlAscending, _</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;DataOption:=xlSortNormal</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .SetRange rng</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .Header = xlYes</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .MatchCase = False</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .Orientation = xlTopToBottom</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .Apply</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; End With</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; \' 4. Aktifkan kembali AutoFilter untuk mencocokkan kriteria Server &amp; Mount</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; rng.AutoFilter Field:=1, Criteria1:=dict.Keys, Operator:=xlFilterValues</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; rng.AutoFilter Field:=2, Criteria1:=keepMounts, Operator:=xlFilterValues</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; \' 5. Perbaikan data (Anti Persen Ribuan &amp; Mengubah pembagi jika nol)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; For i = 2 To lastRow</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; If Not ws.Rows(i).Hidden Then</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \' Disk 0 ubah jadi 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; If ws.Cells(i, \"C\").Value = 0 Then ws.Cells(i, \"C\").Value = 1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \' Normalisasi format data Usage% jika nilainya di atas 1 (ex: 95 menjadi 0.95)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; If IsNumeric(ws.Cells(i, \"D\").Value) Then</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; If ws.Cells(i, \"D\").Value &gt; 1 Then</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ws.Cells(i, \"D\").Value = ws.Cells(i, \"D\").Value / 100</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; End If</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; End If</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; End If</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Next i</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; \' 6. Sentuhan akhir (Formatting &amp; Merapikan Kolom)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ws.Columns(\"D\").NumberFormat = \"0%\"</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ws.Columns(\"B\").Hidden = True&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \' Sembunyikan kolom Mount sesuai instruksi awal</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ws.Columns(\"H\").ClearContents&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\' Hapus sisa angka index di kolom H agar tabel kembali bersih</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Application.ScreenUpdating = True</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; MsgBox \"Storage Report berhasil diproses &amp; diurutkan tanpa error!\", vbInformation</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">End Sub</span></div>',NULL,1),(26,'2026-06-04 00:17:42','Recording','script copy recording','jika ada request ambil recording','<p>find /var/spool/asterisk/monitor/2025/12/29/ -type f -name \"*0811651573*\"</p><p>\r\ncp -Rf /var/spool/asterisk/monitor/2026/01/12/*081376813373* /root/GoogleDrive/RECORDING/REQ231225/</p><p>\r\n\r\nfind /root/GoogleDrive/RECORDING/MTF_TASK_FORCE/2025/12/12 -iname \"*MTF_TASK_FORCE*\" | wc -l\r\n</p><p>find /var/spool/asterisk/monitor/2025/12/12 -iname \"*MTF_TASK_FORCE*\" | wc -l</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">USE beyond_default;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">SELECT noKontrak, DATE(calldate) as Tanggal, userfield&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">FROM `tblCallDataRecords_last`</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">WHERE (DATE(calldate), noKontrak) IN (</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2024-07-04\', \'9392300598\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2024-07-06\', \'9392300246\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2024-12-02\', \'5082300916\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2024-12-04\', \'9232301268\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2025-08-08\', \'9032400643\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2026-02-13\', \'5342401397\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2026-03-02\', \'9092400850\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2026-06-03\', \'9392202721\')</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ORDER BY DATE(calldate) ASC;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">SELECT noKontrak, DATE(calldate) as Tanggal, userfield&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">FROM `tblCallDataRecords_last`</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">WHERE (DATE(calldate), noKontrak) IN (</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2026-02-13\', \'5342401397\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2026-03-02\', \'9092400850\'),</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (\'2026-06-03\', \'9392202721\')</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ORDER BY DATE(calldate) ASC;</span></p>',NULL,1),(28,'2026-06-04 00:25:33','Server','zabbix server merah','server merah di zabix tidak konek','<div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">1. Cek apakah Zabbix Agent hidup (running)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Di server cloudopenvpn2 (IP: 149.129.253.93):</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">CentOS / Rocky / Alma / RHEL</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">systemctl status zabbix-agent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">systemctl restart zabbix-agent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Ubuntu / Debian</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">systemctl status zabbix-agent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">systemctl restart zabbix-agent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Kalau statusnya inactive atau failed, berarti masalahnya di sini.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">2. Pastikan port agent terbuka (default 10050)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Test dari server Zabbix:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">telnet 149.129.253.93 10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">atau</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">nc -vz 149.129.253.93 10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Kalau “Connection refused” ? service mati.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Kalau “Timed out” ? firewall blokir.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">3. Cek firewall server</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">FirewallD</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --list-all</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --add-port=10050/tcp --permanent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --reload</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">UFW</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ufw allow 10050/tcp</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ufw reload</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">4. Cek konfigurasi /etc/zabbix/zabbix_agentd.conf</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Pastikan:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Server=<ip zabbix=\"\" server=\"\"></ip></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ServerActive=<ip zabbix=\"\" server=\"\"></ip></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Hostname=cloudopenvpn2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Contoh:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Server=172.16.0.10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ServerActive=172.16.0.10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Hostname=cloudopenvpn2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Setelah edit:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">systemctl restart zabbix-agent</span></div><div><br></div><div>5. Cek di Zabbix UI (Web)</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Masuk ke:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Monitoring ? Hosts ? cloudopenvpn2 ? tab Latest Data</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Kalau merah, biasanya muncul error seperti:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Get value from agent failed</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">No such file or directory</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Connection timeout 10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Klik ikon ZBX merah ? Details ? akan terlihat pesan error lengkap.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Analisa Tepatnya</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Dari server Zabbix:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">telnet 149.129.253.93 10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Jadi masalahnya sekarang tinggal 2 kemungkinan:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">1. Port 10050 di server 149.129.253.93 tertutup</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Walaupun kamu bisa SSH, belum tentu port 10050 terbuka.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Cek dari server 149.129.253.93:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo systemctl status zabbix-agent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo ss -tlnp | grep 10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Harusnya muncul:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">LISTEN 0 0 0.0.0.0:10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Kalau tidak muncul ? agent tidak jalan.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">2. Firewall di server 149.129.253.93 memblokir port 10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Cek:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">CentOS/RHEL (firewalld)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --list-all</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --add-port=10050/tcp --permanent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --reload</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">UFW (Ubuntu)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ufw status</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ufw allow 10050/tcp</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">iptables</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">iptables -L -n | grep 10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Sekarang kita pastikan dulu:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Tolong jalankan di server 149.129.253.93:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">1 Cek service agent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">systemctl status zabbix-agent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">2 Cek apakah port 10050 listen</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ss -tlnp | grep 10050</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">3 Cek firewall</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">iptables -L -n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">root@OpenVPN2 ~]# firewall-cmd --list-all</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">public</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  target: default</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  icmp-block-inversion: no</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  interfaces:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  sources:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  services: dhcpv6-client ssh</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  ports: 514/udp 514/tcp</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  protocols:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  masquerade: yes</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  forward-ports:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  source-ports:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  icmp-blocks:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">  rich rules:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ChatGPT said:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Terlihat jelas dari output firewall Anda:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">services: dhcpv6-client ssh</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ports: 514/udp 514/tcp</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Tidak ada port 10050 atau 10051 yang di-allow.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Maka Zabbix Server tidak bisa masuk ke agent (port 10050)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Dan Agent juga tidak bisa connect ke server (port 10051)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Inilah penyebab semua error Active Check.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"> SOLUSI: Izinkan port Zabbix</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">1 Izinkan port untuk Zabbix Agent (10050)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --add-port=10050/tcp --permanent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">2 Izinkan port untuk Zabbix Server (10051)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Jika server Zabbix ada di IP 149.129.253.93, maka izinkan juga:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --add-port=10051/tcp --permanent</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">3 Reload firewall</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --reload</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">4 Verifikasi</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">firewall-cmd --list-all</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Harus muncul:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ports: 514/udp 514/tcp 10050/tcp 10051/tcp</span></div>',NULL,1),(29,'2026-06-04 00:28:12','cloud','ssl expaired dan mendaftarkan ssl ','catatan tentang ssl expaired dan mendaftarkan ssl ','<div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">buka ssh load balance 172.16.70.98</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">jalankan ini:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">certbot --nginx -d helpdesk.simgroup.co.id (untuk mendaftarkan ssl, nama nya disesuaikan aja sesuai kebutuhan)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">certbot --force-renewal --nginx -d kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id (untuk perbarui ssl, nama nya disesuaikan aja jika ada yg sudah expaired) </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">lalu ambil filenya disini sesuai dengan nama nya </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">/etc/letsencrypt/live/</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">lalu kita ambil file: </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">-fullchain.pem</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">-privkey.pem</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">file ini untuk di upload di alibaba nya</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">contoh script live ssh:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">root@load-balance:~# certbot --force-renewal --nginx -d helpdesk.simgroup.co.id</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Saving debug log to /var/log/letsencrypt/letsencrypt.log</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Plugins selected: Authenticator nginx, Installer nginx</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Renewing an existing certificate</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Performing the following challenges:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">http-01 challenge for helpdesk.simgroup.co.id</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Waiting for verification...</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Cleaning up challenges</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Deploying Certificate to VirtualHost /etc/nginx/conf.d/helpdesk.simgroup.co.id.conf</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Please choose whether or not to redirect HTTP traffic to HTTPS, removing HTTP access.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">1: No redirect - Make no further changes to the webserver configuration.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">2: Redirect - Make all requests redirect to secure HTTPS access. Choose this for</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">new sites, or if you\'re confident your site works on HTTPS. You can undo this</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">change by editing your web server\'s configuration.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Select the appropriate number [1-2] then [enter] (press \'c\' to cancel): 2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Traffic on port 80 already redirecting to ssl in /etc/nginx/conf.d/helpdesk.simgroup.co.id.conf</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Your existing certificate has been successfully renewed, and the new certificate</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">has been installed.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">The new certificate covers the following domains:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">https://helpdesk.simgroup.co.id</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">You should test your configuration at:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/analyze.html?d=helpdesk.simgroup.co.id</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></div><div><br></div>',NULL,1),(31,'2026-06-04 00:56:28','cloud','membuat DNS lokal dan cloud alibaba','membuat DNS lokal dan cloud alibaba','<p>Membuat DNS baru untuk server on premise</p><p>contoh : Server yang akan dibuat adalah server 172.16.70.81 yang akan dibuat DNS <a href=\"https://kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id</a> </p><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> SSH ke server Load Balance ip 172.16.70.98</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> masuk direktori config nginx di /etc/nginx/conf.d</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong> buat file conf dns nya yaitu kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id.conf</p><p>root@load-balance:/etc/nginx/conf.d# nano kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id.conf dan copy baris dibawah ini:</p><p>server {<br>\r\nserver_name sys.db.bi-bicara.simgroup.co.id  <a href=\"http://www.sys.db.bi-bicara.simgroup.co.id\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" aria-label=\"http://www.sys.db.bi-bicara.simgroup.co.id\" data-tooltip-position=\"top\">www.sys.db.bi-bicara.simgroup.co.id</a>;</p><pre><code>access_log /var/log/nginx/reverse-access-inbound.log;\r\nerror_log /var/log/nginx/reverse-error-inbound.log;\r\n\r\nlocation / {\r\n           proxy_pass http://172.16.70.81:7399;\r\n           proxy_redirect off;\r\n           proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\r\n           proxy_set_header Host sys.db.bi-bicara.simgroup.co.id;\r\n           proxy_connect_timeout 5000s;\r\n           proxy_read_timeout 5000s;\r\n</code></pre><p>  }<br>\r\n}</p><p><strong>Step 4:</strong> setelah itu buat cek conf dan reload service nginxnya</p><p>nginx -t # output harus OK</p><p><strong>Step5:</strong> reload service nginx </p><p>systemctl reload nginx.service</p><p><strong>step6:</strong> Buat records DNS baru dicloudflare -&gt; <a href=\"https://dash.cloudflare.com/eae3ffda149a6f25f33c9543ebd74bf8/simgroup.co.id/dns/records\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://dash.cloudflare.com/eae3ffda149a6f25f33c9543ebd74bf8/simgroup.co.id/dns/records</a> -&gt; add records</p><p>di set seperti ini jika ip local mengarah ke load balance:<br>\r\n<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"image.png\" style=\"width: 685.898px;\"><span class=\"internal-embed\" src=\"Pasted image 20260429160606.png\" alt=\"Pasted image 20260429160606.png\"></span></p><p><span class=\"internal-embed\" src=\"Pasted image 20260429160606.png\" alt=\"Pasted image 20260429160606.png\"><br></span></p><p>jika ip cloud set nya berbeda IPv4 address mengarak ke ip publik, cek ip publiknya di alibaba cloude di instance detail server nya</p><p><strong>Step 7:</strong> lalu buat https dengan jalankan perintah di server loadbalance ip 172.16.70.98</p><p>certbot --nginx -d kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id</p><p>certbot --nginx -d sdmonitoring.simgroup.co.id</p><p>output:<br>\r\nSaving debug log to /var/log/letsencrypt/letsencrypt.log Plugins selected: Authenticator nginx, Installer nginx Obtaining a new certificate Performing the following challenges: http-01 challenge for kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id Waiting for verification... Cleaning up challenges Deploying Certificate to VirtualHost /etc/nginx/conf.d/kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id.conf</p><p>Please choose whether or not to redirect HTTP traffic to HTTPS, removing HTTP access.</p><hr><p>1: No redirect - Make no further changes to the webserver configuration. 2: Redirect - Make all requests redirect to secure HTTPS access. Choose this for new sites, or if you\'re confident your site works on HTTPS. You can undo this change by editing your web server\'s configuration.</p><hr><p>Select the appropriate number [1-2] then [enter] (press \'c\' to cancel): 2 Redirecting all traffic on port 80 to ssl in /etc/nginx/conf.d/kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id.conf</p><hr><p>Congratulations! You have successfully enabled <a href=\"https://kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id</a></p><p>You should test your configuration at: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/analyze.html%3Fd%3Dkardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" aria-label=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/analyze.html%3Fd%3Dkardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id\" data-tooltip-position=\"top\">https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/analyze.html?d=kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id</a></p><hr><p>IMPORTANT NOTES:</p><ul>\r\n<li>Congratulations! Your certificate and chain have been saved at: /etc/letsencrypt/live/kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id/fullchain.pem Your key file has been saved at: /etc/letsencrypt/live/kardex-bicara.simgroup.co.id/privkey.pem Your cert will expire on 2026-05-05. To obtain a new or tweaked version of this certificate in the future, simply run certbot again with the \"certonly\" option. To non-interactively renew <em>all</em> of your certificates, run \"certbot renew\"<br>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>If you like Certbot, please consider supporting our work by:\r\n  Donating to ISRG / Let\'s Encrypt: <a href=\"https://letsencrypt.org/donate\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://letsencrypt.org/donate</a> Donating to EFF: <a href=\"https://eff.org/donate-le\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://eff.org/donate-le</a></li>\r\n</ul><p>jika server dari cloud alibaba kirimkan filenya untuk di upload ke uaf:</p><p>alu ambil filenya disini sesuai dengan nama nya<br>\r\n/etc/letsencrypt/live/</p><p><!-- obsidian -->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p>lalu kita ambil file:<br>\r\n-fullchain.pem<br>\r\n-privkey.pem</p>',NULL,1),(33,'2026-06-04 01:57:51','Server','Menambahkan server baru di grafana','Menambahkan server baru di grafana','<p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">buka server 172.16.30.30</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">cd /etc/prometheus/targets/node/</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">cp node-192-168-0-186.json node-192-168-0-x.json&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">lalu ubah isinya</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">nano node-192-168-0-x.json&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">disesuaikan aja isinya</span></p>',NULL,1),(37,'2026-06-04 07:34:03','Server','Zabbix kendala zabbix-agent.service: failed with result \'exit-code\'','Zabbix kendala zabbix-agent.service: failed with result \'exit-code\'','<!-- obsidian --><p>Zabbix kendala zabbix-agent.service: failed with result \'exit-code\'</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"internal-embed\" src=\"Pasted image 20260506062849.png\" alt=\"Pasted image 20260506062849.png\">Pasted image 20260506062849.png</span></p>\r\n<p>Berikut adalah langkah-langkah untuk memperbaikinya:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Perbaiki Nama Direktori Konfigurasi<br>\r\nJalankan perintah ini untuk mengubah nama folder agar sesuai dengan yang diminta oleh sistem (menghilangkan .conf di tengah):</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Bash<br>\r\nsudo mv /etc/zabbix/zabbix_agentd.conf.d /etc/zabbix/zabbix_agentd.d<br>\r\n2. Pastikan Direktori Log Tersedia<br>\r\nPesan No such file or directory pada log menunjukkan folder /var/log/zabbix/ mungkin belum ada. Mari kita buat dan berikan izin akses ke user zabbix:</p>\r\n<p>Bash<br>\r\nsudo mkdir -p /var/log/zabbix/<br>\r\nsudo chown -R zabbix:zabbix /var/log/zabbix/<br>\r\n3. Jalankan Ulang Service<br>\r\nSetelah struktur folder diperbaiki, lakukan restart pada agent:</p>\r\n<p>Bash<br>\r\nsudo systemctl restart zabbix-agent<br>\r\n4. Verifikasi Hasil<br>\r\nCek status service untuk memastikan sudah berwarna hijau (active/running):</p>\r\n<p>Bash<br>\r\nsudo systemctl status zabbix-agent<br>\r\nKenapa ini terjadi?<br>\r\nZabbix Agent sangat sensitif terhadap jalur (path) yang didefinisikan di dalam file zabbix_agentd.conf. Karena di dalam file tersebut tertulis Include=/etc/zabbix/zabbix_agentd.d/*.conf, maka sistem wajib menemukan folder dengan nama yang sama persis. Jika nama folder berbeda satu karakter saja, service tidak akan mau berjalan.</p>\r\n<p>jangan lupa di allow portnya<br>\r\nsudo ufw allow 10050/tcp</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"internal-embed\" src=\"Pasted image 20260506062923.png\" alt=\"Pasted image 20260506062923.png\">Pasted image 20260506062923.png</span></p>\r\n<p>dipastikan di server grafananya server yg mau di tambahkan sudah konek</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"internal-embed\" src=\"Pasted image 20260506072630.png\" alt=\"Pasted image 20260506072630.png\">Pasted image 20260506072630.png</span></p><p></p>',NULL,1),(38,'2026-06-10 06:41:26','Recording','request tarik recording ke oss di all layanan (banyak tgl)','request tarik recording ke oss di all layanan','<p>buka ssh 30.23</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">/QA_REQ/KOORSODIQREQAMARTHA/cari.sh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">#!/bin/bash</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">FOLDER_BASE=\"oss://simrecording-infrequent/RECORDING/MANUAL/AMARTHA/\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">DEST=\"/QA_REQ/KOORSODIQREQAMARTHA/RTP/\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"># Format: \"PATTERN|DD/MM/YYYY\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">DATA=(</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001280691|06/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001905591|06/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"7754740|07/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002007107|07/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001864001|08/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002016700|09/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"6556518|13/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002073523|13/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"7116300|14/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002581179|14/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001071537|14/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002755490|19/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"6283868|20/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002047087|21/01/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002131517|06/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001765432|11/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001998617|12/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001923743|13/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002569319|20/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"7847082|23/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"7674581|23/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001919901|24/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5000115869|25/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001924770|25/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001736024|27/02/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5003488821|12/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5003488821|12/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002073523|13/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5002073523|13/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001816469|16/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"2300845613|16/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001816469|16/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"2300845613|16/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"2301386448|17/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"2301386448|17/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5003629378|25/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5003629378|25/03/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001897832|15/05/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"5001768572|18/05/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"7982428|22/05/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"8623328|25/05/2026\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">for entry in \"${DATA[@]}\"; do</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; PATTERN=\"${entry%%|*}\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; DATE=\"${entry##*|}\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; # ubah format DD/MM/YYYY ? YYYYMMDD</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; DAY=$(echo \"$DATE\" | cut -d\'/\' -f1)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; MONTH=$(echo \"$DATE\" | cut -d\'/\' -f2)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; YEAR=$(echo \"$DATE\" | cut -d\'/\' -f3)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; FOLDER=\"${FOLDER_BASE}${YEAR}${MONTH}${DAY}/\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; echo \"Copy pola $PATTERN dari tanggal $DATE ($FOLDER)\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ossutil cp -r \"$FOLDER\" \"$DEST\" --include \"*$PATTERN*\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">done</span></p>',NULL,1),(39,'2026-06-10 08:42:00','Recording','request tarik recording ke oss di all layanan pertanggal','request tarik recording ke oss di all layanan pertanggal','<p>buka ssh 30.23</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">path nya di /QA_REQ/cari.sh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">#!/bin/bash</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">FOLDER=\"oss://simrecording-infrequent/RECORDING/MQUEUE/2026/05/29/\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">DEST=\"/QA_REQ/\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">PATTERNS=(</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\"9732000567\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">for p in \"${PATTERNS[@]}\"; do</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; echo \"Copy file dengan pola: $p\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ossutil cp -r \"$FOLDER\" \"$DEST\" --include \"*$p*\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">done</span></p><div><br></div>',NULL,1),(40,'2026-06-10 13:06:06','cloud','membuat sub domain di rumah web','membuat sub domain di rumah web','<h1 data-path-to-node=\"3\">TUTORIAL MEMBUAT SUBDOMAIN (cPanel Rumahweb)</h1><h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Langkah 1: Membuat Virtual Directory Subdomain di cPanel</b></h3><p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Langkah awal adalah mendaftarkan nama subdomain ke dalam sistem hosting cPanel Anda.</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"6\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">Masuk (<i data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"7\">login</i>) ke akun <b data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">cPanel</b> Anda.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\">Cari dan buka menu <b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"19\">Domains</b> di kolom pencarian cPanel.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\">Klik tombol <b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">Create A New Domain</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\">Di kolom <b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">Domain</b>, masukkan nama subdomain lengkap Anda (Contoh: <code data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">blog.adventure55.my.id</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\">Pastikan centang pada pilihan <i data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">\"Share document root\"</i> <b data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">dimatikan / dikosongkan</b>. Ini penting agar subdomain memiliki folder terpisah dari domain utama.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\">Kolom <b data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"6\">Document Root</b> akan terisi otomatis menjadi folder fisik baru di dalam <code data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">public_html</code> (Contoh: <code data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">public_html/blog.adventure55.my.id</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0\">Klik <b data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"5\">Submit</b>.</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node=\"7\"><h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Langkah 2: Mengarahkan DNS (Zone Editor)</b></h3><p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Setelah subdomain didaftarkan di hosting, Anda harus memberi tahu server global ke IP mana subdomain tersebut harus diarahkan.</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"10\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">Kembali ke halaman utama cPanel, lalu buka menu <b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Zone Editor</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">Cari domain utama Anda (<code data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">adventure55.my.id</code>), lalu klik tombol <b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Manage</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\">Klik <b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"5\">Add Record</b> (pilih tipe <b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">A Record</b>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\">Isi kolomnya sebagai berikut:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Name:</b> <code data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"6\">blog.adventure55.my.id.</code> (jangan lupa tanda titik di ujungnya jika cPanel memintanya).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">TTL:</b> <code data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"5\">14400</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Type:</b> <code data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"6\">A</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Record / Value:</b> Masukkan <b data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\">Shared IP Address</b> hosting Anda (Contoh IP Anda tadi: <code data-path-to-node=\"10,3,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">203.175.9.135</code>).</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\">Klik <b data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"5\">Save Record</b>.</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node=\"11\"><h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Langkah 3: Memasang Sertifikat SSL Keamanan (HTTPS)</b></h3><p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Agar subdomain bisa diakses dengan aman menggunakan <code data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">https://</code>, sertifikat SSL harus diterbitkan.</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"14\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\">Buka menu <b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"10\">SSL/TLS Status</b> atau <b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">LetsEncrypt</b> di cPanel Anda.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\">Cari nama subdomain baru Anda (<code data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">blog.adventure55.my.id</code>) di dalam daftar.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\">Centang kotak di sebelah nama subdomain tersebut, lalu klik tombol <b data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">Run AutoSSL</b> atau <b data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"84\">Issue Certificate</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\">Tunggu beberapa menit hingga statusnya berubah menjadi hijau bertuliskan <i data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">\"Validated\"</i>.</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node=\"15\"><h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Langkah 4: Menyiapkan Database MySQL</b></h3><p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Jika subdomain Anda membutuhkan aplikasi berbasis database (seperti aplikasi PHP yang Anda buat), lakukan konfigurasi database ini:</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"18\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\">Buka menu <b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"10\">MySQL® Databases</b> di cPanel.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Buat Database Baru:</b> Di bagian <i data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">Create New Database</i>, isi nama database Anda (Contoh: <code data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"83\">advs6319_adventure</code>), lalu klik <i data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"114\">Create Database</i>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Buat User Baru:</b> Scroll ke bawah ke bagian <i data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">Add New User</i>, buat username (Contoh: <code data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"79\">advs6319_angga</code>) beserta password-nya, lalu klik <i data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"127\">Create User</i>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hubungkan User ke Database (Paling Penting):</b> * Scroll ke bagian <i data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">Add User To Database</i>.</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1,0,0\">Pilih <b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"6\">User</b> dan <b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"15\">Database</b> yang baru Anda buat tadi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1,1,0\">Klik tombol <b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">Add</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1,2,0\">Di halaman berikutnya, centang kotak <b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">ALL PRIVILEGES</b>, lalu klik <b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">Make Changes</b> di bagian bawah.</p></li></ul></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node=\"19\"><h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Langkah 5: Mengunggah File Codingan (File Manager)</b></h3><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"21\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\">Buka menu <b data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"10\">File Manager</b> di cPanel.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\">Masuk ke folder <code data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">public_html</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\">Masuk ke dalam folder khusus subdomain Anda (<code data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">blog.adventure55.my.id</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\">Klik tombol <b data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">Upload</b> di bagian atas untuk mengunggah file PHP Anda (seperti <code data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">index.php</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">config.php</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">tambah.php</code>, dsb.).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0\">Edit file koneksi database Anda (misal <code data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">config.php</code>), pastikan nama DB, User, dan Password-nya diisi sama persis dengan yang Anda buat di <b data-path-to-node=\"21,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"136\">Langkah 4</b>.</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node=\"22\"><h3 data-path-to-node=\"23\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">&nbsp;Catatan Penting Setelah Selesai Pembuatan (Masa Propagasi DNS):</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"24\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\">Setelah langkah-langkah di atas selesai, subdomain <b data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">tidak selalu langsung bisa dibuka di semua perangkat / koneksi internet</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\">Jaringan internet (ISP) seperti Wi-Fi rumah atau kantor sering kali membutuhkan waktu <b data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">1 s.d. 24 jam</b> untuk mengenali alamat subdomain baru Anda (<i data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"144\">Propagasi DNS</i>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tips Testing Cepat:</b> Gunakan <b data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Paket Data HP</b> lewat mode <b data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Incognito/Rahasia</b> pada browser untuk mengecek hasil akhirnya terlebih dahulu, karena DNS provider seluler biasanya mendeteksi perubahan jauh lebih cepat.</p></li></ul>',NULL,1),(41,'2026-06-14 03:48:14','Server','Panduan Pembersihan Storage Server openvpncloud (Kasus: Log & ntopng Bloat)','Panduan Pembersihan Storage Server Linux (Kasus: Log & ntopng Bloat)','<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Tahap 1: Analisis Awal (Mencari Tersangka Utama)</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"6\">Sebelum menghapus apa pun, cari tahu direktori mana yang memakan ruang paling besar.</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cek Kapasitas Disk Global</b></p><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!--