hwa perintah berhasil dijalankan (<i data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">The command completed successfully</i>), dan jam di pojok kanan bawah Windows Anda akan langsung berubah tepat waktu.</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node=\"19\">Langkah 5: Cek Waktu Akhir</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"20\">Terakhir, Anda bisa memastikan jam dan tanggal saat ini sudah sesuai dengan mengetik:</p><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c1376676189-176 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fd95416040b36aba&quot;,&quot;c_3935a8bdd2b05412&quot;,null,&quot;rc_38cf1758a7019fa8&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjwsIOQgo2VAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQugM\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1376676189-176\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c1376676189-176\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1376676189-176 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1376676189-176\">DOS</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c1376676189-176 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"arrow_circle_down\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Download code\" gemtooltip=\"Download code\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1376676189-176 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c1220514461=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-124\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1220514461=\"\" maticonbutton=\"\" matbadgeposition=\"after\" class=\"mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted\" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized=\"\" mat-ripple-loader-class-name=\"mat-mdc-button-ripple\" mat-ripple-loader-centered=\"\" aria-label=\"Download code\" jslog=\"305704;track:generic_click,impression\"><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple\"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1220514461=\"\" _nghost-ng-c3998111092=\"\"><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3998111092=\"\" role=\"img\" class=\"mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-mat-icon-type=\"font\" data-mat-icon-name=\"arrow_circle_down\" data-mat-icon-namespace=\"lumi-symbols\" fonticon=\"arrow_circle_down\"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class=\"mat-focus-indicator\"></span><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-touch-target\"></span></button><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1376676189-176 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c1220514461=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-125\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1220514461=\"\" maticonbutton=\"\" matbadgeposition=\"after\" class=\"mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted\" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized=\"\" mat-ripple-loader-class-name=\"mat-mdc-button-ripple\" mat-ripple-loader-centered=\"\" aria-label=\"Copy code\" jslog=\"179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fd95416040b36aba&quot;,&quot;c_3935a8bdd2b05412&quot;,null,&quot;rc_38cf1758a7019fa8&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true\"><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple\"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1220514461=\"\" _nghost-ng-c3998111092=\"\"><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3998111092=\"\" role=\"img\" class=\"mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-mat-icon-type=\"font\" data-mat-icon-name=\"copy\" data-mat-icon-namespace=\"lumi-symbols\" fonticon=\"copy\"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class=\"mat-focus-indicator\"></span><span class=\"mat-mdc-button-touch-target\"></span></button><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1376676189-176\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1376676189=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1376676189-176\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">time</span> /t\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><p data-path-to-node=\"22\">Perintah di atas akan memunculkan waktu saat ini (misalnya: <code data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">08:51 AM</code>).</p><p><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1376676189=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1376676189-176 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></p><p data-path-to-node=\"23\">Langkah mana yang sedang Anda coba sekarang? Beritahu saya jika Anda menemukan kendala atau pesan eror di salah satu langkahnya.</p>',NULL,1),(44,'2026-06-20 03:01:13','Server','konfigurasi fs dengan samba dilinux new','konfigurasi fs dengan samba dilinux new','<p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">tutorial dari nol sampai bisa akses untuk Samba Ubuntu. Saya buat 2 skenario:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">FS pakai user + password (private)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">FS tanpa password (guest/public)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Contoh kita buat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">/srv/</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp;angga-fs&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (pakai password)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">share-data&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (tanpa password)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">A. Install Samba Ubuntu</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Update:&nbsp;</span>sudo apt update</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Install:&nbsp;</span>sudo apt install samba -y</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Cek service:&nbsp;</span>systemctl status smbd</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">B. Backup konfigurasi Samba</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Sebelum edit:&nbsp;</span>sudo cp /etc/samba/smb.conf /etc/samba/smb.conf.backup</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">C. Buat folder FS</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Contoh buat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo mkdir -p /srv/angga-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo mkdir -p /srv/share-data</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Cek:&nbsp;</span>ls -ld /srv/*</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">D. Buat FS pakai USER + PASSWORD</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">1. Buat user Linux</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Contoh user:&nbsp;</span>angga</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">buat:&nbsp;</span>sudo adduser angga</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">isi password Linux.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">2. Buat password Samba</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Ini password yang dipakai Windows:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo smbpasswd -a angga</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">contoh:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">New SMB password:&nbsp;</span>angga123</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Retype:&nbsp;</span>angga123</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">3. Permission folder</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Folder </span>angga-fs<span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo chown -R angga:angga /srv/angga-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">permission:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo chmod -R 770 /srv/angga-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">cek:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ls -ld /srv/angga-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">hasil:&nbsp;</span>drwxrwx--- angga angga /srv/angga-fs</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">E. Buat FS TANPA PASSWORD (Guest)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Folder:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">/srv/share-data</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ubah owner:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo chown -R nobody:nogroup /srv/share-data</span></p><p>permission:</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo chmod -R 777 /srv/share-data</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">F. Edit Samba Config</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Buka:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo nano /etc/samba/smb.conf</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Tambahkan paling bawah:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">*FS pakai password*</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[angga-fs]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">path = /srv/angga-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">browseable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">writable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">guest ok = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">valid users = angga</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">read only = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">create mask = 0660</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">directory mask = 0770</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">*FS tanpa password*</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[share-data]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">path = /srv/share-data</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">browseable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">writable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">guest ok = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">read only = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">force user = nobody</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">force group = nogroup</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">create mask = 0660</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">directory mask = 0770</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">G. Cek Config</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Jalankan:&nbsp;</span>testparm</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Kalau muncul:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Loaded services file OK</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">berarti aman.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">H. Restart Samba</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">sudo systemctl restart smbd</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">cek:&nbsp;</span>systemctl status smbd</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">I. Akses dari Windows</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Tekan:&nbsp;</span>Windows + R</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">1. FS password</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Masuk:&nbsp;</span>\\\\IP-SERVER\\angga-fs</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">contoh:&nbsp;</span>\\\\172.16.29.55\\angga-fs</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Muncul:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Network Credentials</span></p><p>Username:<span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">angga</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Password:</span>angga123</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Berhasil.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">2. FS tanpa password</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Masuk:&nbsp;</span>\\172.16.29.55\\share-data</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">langsung terbuka.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">J. Kalau mau buat FS baru lagi</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Misal mau:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">/srv/laporan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Tanpa password</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Buat folder:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">mkdir /srv/laporan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">permission:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">chown -R nobody:nogroup /srv/laporan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">chmod -R 777 /srv/laporan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Tambahkan:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[laporan]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">path = /srv/laporan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">browseable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">writable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">guest ok = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">read only = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">force user = nobody</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">force group = nogroup</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">restart:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">systemctl restart smbd</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">akses:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\\\\IP-SERVER\\laporan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Dengan password user baru</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Misal user:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">agent</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">buat:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">adduser agent</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">buat password Samba:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">smbpasswd -a agent</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">folder:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">mkdir /srv/agent-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">permission:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">chown -R agent:agent /srv/agent-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">chmod -R 770 /srv/agent-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">config:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[agent-fs]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">path = /srv/agent-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">browseable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">writable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">guest ok = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">valid users = agent</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">read only = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">create mask = 0660</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">directory mask = 0770</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">restart:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">systemctl restart smbd</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">akses:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\\\\IP-SERVER\\agent-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">login:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">agent</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">password samba</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Troubleshoot paling sering</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Kalau Windows minta password terus:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">hapus cache:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">CMD:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">net use * /delete</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">lalu buka lagi.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Dengan pola ini nanti server Anda bisa punya banyak FS:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">/srv/</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">angga-fs&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; user/pass</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">share-data&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; tanpa password</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">laporan&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;guest</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">finance&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; finance user</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">agent&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; agent user</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">dan tiap folder punya akses sendiri-sendiri. ????</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">realnya smb.conf</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"># See smb.conf.example for a more detailed config file or</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"># read the smb.conf manpage.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"># Run \'testparm\' to verify the config is correct after</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"># you modified it.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[global]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>workgroup = WORKGROUP</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>security = user&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>map to guest = Bad User</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; guest account = nobody</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>passdb backend = tdbsam</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>printing = cups</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>printcap name = cups</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>load printers = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>cups options = raw</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>server min protocol = SMB2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>server max protocol = SMB3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[angga-fs]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">path = /srv/angga-fs</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">browseable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">writable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">guest ok = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">valid users = angga</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">read only = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">create mask = 0660</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">directory mask = 0770</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[share-data]</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">path = /srv/share-data</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">browseable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">writable = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">guest ok = yes</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">read only = no</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">create mask = 0660</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">directory mask = 0770</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">force user = nobody</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">force group = nogroup</span></p>',NULL,1),(45,'2026-06-29 00:58:23','Server',' CARA MENAMBAHKAN MIKROTIK KE WIREGUARD SERVER CLOUD','CARA MENAMBAHKAN MIKROTIK KE WIREGUARD SERVER CLOUD','<p><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;apple color emoji&quot;, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">CARA MENAMBAHKAN MIKROTIK KE WIREGUARD SERVER CLOUD</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;apple color emoji&quot;, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">\r\n\r\n==============================\r\n</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;apple color emoji&quot;, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> BAGIAN 1 — DI SERVER (DOCKER)\r\n=================================\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, &quot;apple color emoji&quot;, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1.Edit file konfigurasi WireGuard:\r\n\r\n</span></p><pre class=\"quote-like quote-like-border code\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Roboto Mono&quot;, monospace; --font-size: calc(16px - 2px); margin: 0.25rem 0px; font-size: 14px; --border-radius: .25rem; --primary-color: rgb(204,80,73); --primary-color-rgb: 204,80,73; background-color: rgba(204, 80, 73, 0.