n style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">|&nbsp; `- Journal matches:&nbsp; _SYSTEMD_UNIT=sshd.service + _COMM=sshd</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">`- Actions</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;|- Currently banned: 1</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;|- Total banned:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;`- Banned IP list:&nbsp; &nbsp;192.168.5.220</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[root@Mtf-auto ~]# fail2ban-client set sshd unbanip 192.168.5.220</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">1</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">You have new mail in /var/spool/mail/root</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[root@Mtf-auto ~]# sudo fail2ban-client status sshd</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">Status for the jail: sshd</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">|- Filter</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">|&nbsp; |- Currently failed: 0</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">|&nbsp; |- Total failed:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;8</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">|&nbsp; `- Journal matches:&nbsp; _SYSTEMD_UNIT=sshd.service + _COMM=sshd</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">`- Actions</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;|- Currently banned: 0</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;|- Total banned:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;`- Banned IP list:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">[root@Mtf-auto ~]#</span></p><div><br></div>',NULL,1),(48,'2026-07-06 11:05:58','Server','cek user yg ada di server dan menambahkan user baru kasih akses sudo','cek user yg ada di server dan menambahkan user baru kasih akses sudo','<p><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">masuk ssh server</span></p><p>Melihat semua user yang \"PUNYA HAK\" akses (Baik yang sedang login maupun yang sedang offline/belum akses)<span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">grep -E \'/bash|/sh\' /etc/passwd</span></p><p>-Tambahkan User Baru</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">useradd itbaru</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p>-Buat Password untuk User Baru</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">passwd itbaru</span></p><p><br></p><p>Berikan Akses Sudo (Administrator)</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">usermod -aG wheel itbaru</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p>Cara Mengetesnya:</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">su - itbaru</span><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Lalu tes apakah hak <code data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"20\">sudo</code>-nya sudah aktif dengan menjalankan perintah ini:</p><div _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c1605810258-175 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[\"r_8b6cd30152260888\",\"c_0f7b12e56b0b447d\",null,\"rc_5fee039f12d2dbf1\",null,null,\"en\",null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwiugcu2triVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQxQQ\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1605810258-175 ng-star-inserted\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c1605810258-175 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1605810258-175 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c1551972677=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-161\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1605810258-175\">sudo whoami</code></pre><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><br></code></pre><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1605810258-175\">untuk mengganti password user yang sudah ada</code></pre><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3px;\">passwd nama_user</span></code></pre><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3px;\"><br></span></code></pre><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">Setelah menekan Enter, sistem akan memunculkan teks <code data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">Changing password for user sdsmg.</code> dan meminta Anda mengetikkan password baru (<code data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"130\">New password:</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">Masukkan password baru, lalu tekan Enter.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\">Sistem akan meminta konfirmasi ulang (<code data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">Retype new password:</code>). Masukkan kembali password yang sama, lalu tekan Enter.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Catatan Keamanan:</b> Sama seperti sebelumnya, saat Anda mengetikkan password, karakter/hurufnya memang <b data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"100\">tidak akan muncul</b> di layar. Ketik saja dengan yakin sampai selesai.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Jika muncul pesan <code data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">passwd: all authentication tokens updated successfully.</code>, berarti password user tersebut sudah berhasil diganti!</p></code></pre><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1605810258=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1605810258-175\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3px;\"><br></span></code></pre></div></div></div><p><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1605810258=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c1605810258-175 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----></code-block></response-element><br></p>',NULL,1),(49,'2026-07-07 10:50:56','Server','ALLOW IP LAYANAN BARU YG PAKE OPENVPN SEMARANG','ALLOW IP LAYANAN BARU YG PAKE OPENVPN SEMARANG','<p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">149.129.246.15 ssh openvpn semarang</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span 