u sampai prompt terminal kembali muncul.</i></p><h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Langkah 3: Pengaturan Jaringan &amp; Firewall (Penting!)</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Agar aplikasi dari IP lain (seperti IP <code data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">172.16.70.12</code> milik aplikasimu) bisa terhubung, pastikan dua hal ini aman:</p><h4 data-path-to-node=\"17\">A. Pastikan Port MySQL Terbuka di Firewall Server</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Ketik perintah ini di terminal untuk mengizinkan koneksi dari luar masuk ke port <code data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">3306</code>:</p><div _ngcontent-ng-c4101540782=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c4101540782-652 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_963635730cc774b2&quot;,&quot;c_6219d53eff31b8ee&quot;,null,&quot;rc_5a217f30427dfa24&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjshYan8cKVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ9go\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4101540782=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4101540782-652\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4101540782=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c4101540782-652\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4101540782=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c4101540782-652 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c4101540782=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c4101540782-652\">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4101540782=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c4101540782-652 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c4101540782=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"arrow_circle_down\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Download code\" gemtooltip=\"Download code\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c4101540782-652 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c119071