!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\">Ikuti instruksi pembuatan remote baru:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,0,0\">Pilih <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"6\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"6\">n</code></b> (New remote).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,1,0\">Beri nama: <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"11\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"11\">gdrive</code></b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,2,0\">Pilih tipe storage: Ketik <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"26\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"26\">drive</code></b> (atau pilih nomor untuk Google Drive).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,3,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">client_id</code> &amp; <code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">client_secret</code>: <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"27\">Kosongkan</b> (langsung tekan <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Enter</b>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,4,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">scope</code>: Pilih nomor <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"19\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"19\">1</code></b> (Full access).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,5,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">root_folder_id</code> &amp; <code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">service_account_file</code>: <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">Kosongkan</b> (langsung tekan <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">Enter</b>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,6,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Edit advanced config?</code>: Pilih <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"29\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">n</code></b> (No).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,7,0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Use auto config?</code>: Pilih <b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"24\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,1,1,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">y</code></b> (Yes).</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\">Browser laptop akan terbuka otomatis. <b data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">Pilih akun Gmail</b> yang ingin dihubungkan, lalu klik <b data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Continue / Allow</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\">Setelah muncul tulisan <i data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">\"Success!\"</i> di browser, kembali ke CMD laptop.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0\">Pada pilihan <code data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"13\">Keep this \"gdrive\" remote?</code>, pilih <b data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"47\">y</code></b> (Yes).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"17,5,0\">Keluar dari menu konfigurasi dengan mengetik <b data-path-to-node=\"17,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\"><code data-path-to-node=\"17,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">q</code></b> (Quit).</p></li></ol><h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\">LANGKAH 3: PEMINDAHAN TOKEN KE SERVER</h2><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"20\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\">Di <b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">CMD laptop</b>, jalankan perintah berikut untuk menampilkan isi kuncinya:</p><respons