<span class=\"hljs-literal\">on</span>line.target\r\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">Wants</span>=network-<span class=\"hljs-literal\">on</span>line.target\r\n\r\n<span class=\"hljs-section\">[Service]</span>\r\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">Type</span>=simple\r\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">ExecStart</span>=/usr/bin/rclone mount gdrive: /mnt/gdrive \\\r\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">--config</span>=/root/.config/rclone/rclone.conf \\\r\n  --allow-other \\\r\n  --umask 000 \\\r\n  --vfs-cache-mode writes \\\r\n  --drive-chunk-size 64M \\\r\n  --fast-list\r\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">ExecStop</span>=/bin/fusermount -u /mnt/gdrive\r\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">Restart</span>=always\r\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">RestartSec</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">15</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"hljs-section\">[Install]</span>\r\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">WantedBy</span>=multi-user.target\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\">Simpan dengan menekan <b data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\"><code data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">Ctrl + O</code></b> -&gt; <b data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\"><code data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">Enter</code></b> -&gt; <b data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\"><code data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Ctrl + X</code></b>.</p></li></ol><h2 data-path-to-node=\"26\">LANGKAH 5: AKTIVASI DAN PENGUJIAN</h2><p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Terapkan service baru tersebut di server dengan menjalankan perintah berikut secara berurutan:</p><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c2573898905-196 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_3cc278e373c6a787&quot;,&quot;c_988b9e7c902c3a2b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_a1eeab81ddb2031b&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjjjaSR_dCVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ0AE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2573898905-196\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c2573898905-196\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c2573898905-196 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c2573898905-196\">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c2573898905-196 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"arrow_circle_down\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Download code\" gemtooltip=\"Download code\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c2573898905-196 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c2003038684=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-19\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----><br></gem-icon-button><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2573898905-196 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c2003038684=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-20\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c2573898905-196\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c2573898905-196\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Daftarkan service baru ke sistem</span>\r\nsudo systemctl daemon-reload\r\n\r\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Aktifkan service agar otomatis menyala saat server reboot</span>\r\nsudo systemctl <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">enable</span> rclone-gdrive\r\n\r\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Jalankan servicenya sekarang</span>\r\nsudo systemctl restart rclone-gdrive\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><h3 data-path-to-node=\"29\">Cara Cek Hasil Akhir:</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"30\">Tunggu sekitar 15–30 detik agar sistem melakukan mounting, lalu cek isi foldernya langsung:</p><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c2573898905-197 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_3cc278e373c6a787&quot;,&quot;c_988b9e7c902c3a2b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_a1eeab81ddb2031b&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjjjaSR_dCVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ0QE\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2573898905-197\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c2573898905-197\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c2573898905-197 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2573898905=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c2