;\">find . -type f -newermt \"2024-01-01\" ! -newermt \"2024-12-31\"</span></p><p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">delete file dengan range&nbsp;</span></p><p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">find . -type f -newermt \"2024-01-01\" ! -newermt \"2024-12-31\" -delete</span></p><p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"0\">Script/perintah <code data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">find</code> tersebut digunakan di Linux untuk <b data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">mencari dan menghapus file secara otomatis berdasarkan rentang tanggal modifikasi/pembuatannya</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Berikut adalah penjelasan detail per bagian:</p><h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Pengecekan Rentang File (Cek Dulu)</b></h3><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c427156625-45 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_66e955bd7aaacdc2&quot;,&quot;c_073462331d384dbd&quot;,null,&quot;rc_02ecb8da7ffc9b51&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahcKEwjnmrXZyOWVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQcg\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c427156625-45\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c427156625-45\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c427156625-45 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-45\">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c427156625-45 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"arrow_circle_down\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Download code\" gemtooltip=\"Download code\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c427156625-45 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c374551268=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-40\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----><br></gem-icon-button><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c427156625-45 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c374551268=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-41\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-45\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c427156625-45\">find . -<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">type</span> f -newermt <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"2024-01-01\"</span> ! -newermt <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"2024-12-31\"</span>\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Perintah ini berfungsi untuk <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">menampilkan daftar file</b> yang sesuai dengan kriteria tanpa menghapusnya terlebih dahulu (sangat disarankan untuk verifikasi sebelum eksekusi hapus).</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"6\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">find .</code></b> : Menjalankan pencarian di direktori aktif saat ini (<code data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">.</code>) dan seluruh sub-direktorinya. (Sesuai konteks Anda, perintah ini dijalankan dari direktori <code data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"154\">/opt/tomcat/storage/report/tasks/</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">-type f</code></b> : Membatasi pencarian <b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">hanya untuk file</b> (mengabaikan folder/direktori).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">-newermt \"2024-01-01\"</code></b> : Mencari file yang <b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">diubah/dibuat setelah atau pada tanggal 1 Januari 2024</b> jam 00:00.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">! -newermt \"2024-12-31\"</code></b> : Tanda <code data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">!</code> berarti <i data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">NOT</i> (negasi). Jadi argumen ini mencari file yang <b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">TIDAK diubah/dibuat setelah tanggal 31 Desember 2024</b>. Dengan kata lain, batas akhirnya adalah sampai 31 Desember 2024.</p></li></ul><blockquote data-path-to-node=\"7\"><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ringkasan:</b> Perintah ini menampilkan seluruh file tahun <b data-path-to-node=\"7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">2024</b> (1 Jan 2024 - 31 Des 2024).</p></blockquote><h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Penghapusan File</b></h3><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c427156625-46 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_66e955bd7aaacdc2&quot;,&quot;c_073462331d384dbd&quot;,null,&quot;rc_02ecb8da7ffc9b51&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahcKEwjnmrXZyOWVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQcw\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c427156625-46\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c427156625-46\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c427156625-46 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-46\">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c427156625-46 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"arrow_circle_down\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Download code\" gemtooltip=\"Download code\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c427156625-46 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c374551268=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-40\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----><br></gem-icon-button><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c427156625-46 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c374551268=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-41\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-46\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c427156625-46\">find . -<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">type</span> f -newermt <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"2024-01-01\"</span> ! -newermt <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"2024-12-31\"</span> -delete\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Perintah ini memiliki kriteria pencarian yang sama persis dengan opsi di atas, tetapi ditambahkan parameter di paling ujung:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><code data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">-delete</code></b> : Langsung <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"19\">menghapus secara permanen</b> setiap file yang cocok dengan kriteria rentang tanggal tersebut tanpa meminta konfirmasi lagi.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Tips &amp; Catatan Penting</b></h3><p><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-45 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-46 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"15\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Jalankan di Folder yang Tepat:</b>\r\nSebelum menjalankan perintah <code data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">find .</code>, pastikan Anda sudah masuk ke direktori tujuan dengan perintah:</p><response-element class=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-47 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c427156625-47 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_66e955bd7aaacdc2&quot;,&quot;c_073462331d384dbd&quot;,null,&quot;rc_02ecb8da7ffc9b51&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahcKEwjnmrXZyOWVAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQdA\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c427156625-47\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c427156625-47\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c427156625-47 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-47\">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c427156625-47 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"arrow_circle_down\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Download code\" gemtooltip=\"Download code\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c427156625-47 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c374551268=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-40\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----><br></gem-icon-button><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c427156625-47 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c374551268=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-41\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c427156625-47\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c427156625=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c427156625-47\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cd</span> /opt/tomcat/storage/report/tasks/\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Amankan dengan Cek Dulu:</b>\r\nSelalu jalankan perintah pencarian (tanpa <code data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">-delete</code>) terlebih dahulu untuk memastikan tidak ada file penting yang tidak sengaja terikut sebelum benar-benar mengeksekusi <code data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"192\">-delete</code>.</p></li></ol>',NULL,1),(57,'2026-08-01 05:55:09','Security','user dan password folder sharing','akses folder sharing','<p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">edit file host:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">isi ini </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">172.16.29.69 fs-kranggan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">172.16.29.69 kranggan3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">untuk manipulasi agar terlihat host nya berbeda.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p>172.16.29.69 <span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\\\\fs-kranggan\\FS-Kranggan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">user: agent-kranggan</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">apass: agent123</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p>172.16.29.69 <span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\\\\kranggan3\\kranggan_3:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">user: kranggan3</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">pass: kranggan3ok</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br></span></p><p>\\\\kranggan3\\fsmuf:</p><p>user: user-muf</p><p>pass: 2024#muf</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br>172.16.29.123<br>user: guest<br>pass:sim123</span></p><p><br></p><p>172.16.71.155</p><p>user: guest</p><p>pass:brekele123</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">\\\\172.16.10.10</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">ho_2107</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">14Xw9KBGS#</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\"><br><br></span></p>',NULL,1),(58,'2026-08-06 06:38:44','Server','telko pkp kendala alihin di mikrotik','telko pkp kendala alihin di mikrotik','<p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px;\">==================================telko pkp===========================</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>-main biznet</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">		</span>103.113.133.30 (router 70.1) -&gt; 192.168.2.2</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">		</span>103.113.133.30 (router 85.1) -&gt; 192.168.18.1</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre; font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\">	</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>-backup e-forte</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">		</span>103.113.133.30 (router 70.1) -&gt; 192.168.2.2 (disable)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">		</span>103.113.133.30 (router 85.1) -&gt; 192.168.2.1</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre; font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\">		</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">		</span>attention clear conection firewall-&gt;conection-&gt;filter dst 103.113.133.30 ctrl+A dell</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15.2px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">			</span>asterisk - sip reload dialplan reload hangup request all</span></p>',NULL,1),(59,'2026-08-08 23:19:52','Server','ganti pass server dan pakai pass generate','ganti pass server dan pakai pass generate','<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\">Kenapa Harus Pakai Password Generator?</h3><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"4\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sangat Aman:</b> Menghasilkan kombinasi acak dari huruf besar, huruf kecil, angka, dan simbol (contoh: <code data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">k8#mP9!vX2@qL</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bebas dari Tebakan:</b> Tidak menggunakan kata-kata yang ada hubungannya dengan data pribadi Anda.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standar Keamanan Server:</b> Server Linux sangat rentan diserang <i data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">bot</i> (brute-force attack) jika password root-nya terlalu sederhana.</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Cara Menggunakannya di Server Anda (Yang Sedang Terbuka)</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Karena Anda sudah <i data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">login</i> sebagai <code data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">root</code> di MobaXterm, Anda bisa langsung membuat password acak menggunakan perintah bawaan Linux berikut:</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"8\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ketik perintah ini di terminal:</b></p><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3142442884-93 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c3142442884-93 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_083f26036a132067&quot;,&quot;c_c24f93208a2ab401&quot;,null,&quot;rc_284eaf3f46d906ab&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"3\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c3142442884-93\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c3142442884-93\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c3142442884-93 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3142442884-93\">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c3142442884-93 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c3142442884-93 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c1462083944=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-44\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3142442884-93\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c3142442884-93\">openssl rand -base64 12\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tekan Enter.</b> Di layar akan keluar teks acak seperti: <code data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">a8F#kL2m9PzX</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Salin/Simpan</b> teks acak tersebut di tempat aman (misalnya di Password Manager atau catatan pribadi Anda).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ganti password root</b> Anda dengan mengetik:</p><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3142442884-94 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"code-block ng-tns-c3142442884-94 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation\" jslog=\"223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_083f26036a132067&quot;,&quot;c_c24f93208a2ab401&quot;,null,&quot;rc_284eaf3f46d906ab&quot;,null,null,&quot;id&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" data-hveid=\"6\"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c3142442884-94\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c3142442884-94\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c3142442884-94 ng-star-inserted\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3142442884-94\">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"buttons ng-tns-c3142442884-94 ng-star-inserted\"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"onSurface\" size=\"small\" fonticonname=\"copy\" theme=\"lm\" arialabel=\"Copy code\" gemtooltip=\"Copy code\" data-test-id=\"gem-copy-button\" class=\"mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c3142442884-94 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted\" _nghost-ng-c1462083944=\"\" aria-describedby=\"cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-44\" cdk-describedby-host=\"ng-1\"><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" class=\"ng-tns-c3142442884-94\"><code _ngcontent-ng-c3142442884=\"\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\" class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c3142442884-94\">passwd\r\n</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\">Paste/ketik password acak yang tadi sudah dibuat.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node=\"10\"><i data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Alternatif lain: Anda juga bisa menggunakan web password generator di HP/Browser laptop Anda (seperti generator dari 1Password atau Bitwarden), lalu salin hasilnya untuk dijadikan password root server.</i></p>',NULL,1),(63,'2026-09-04 06:32:17','Jaringan','routing sehati tarik data dari mikrotik kr3','routing sehati tarik data','<p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><b>[angga@ROUTER KR3] &gt; tool/traceroute 10.8.8.28</b></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><b>Columns: ADDRESS, LOSS, SENT, LAST, AVG, BEST, WORST, STD-DEV</b></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><b>#&nbsp; ADDRESS&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; LOSS&nbsp; SENT&nbsp; LAST&nbsp; &nbsp; AVG&nbsp; &nbsp;BEST&nbsp; WORST&nbsp; STD-DEV</b></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><b>0&nbsp; 192.168.2.2&nbsp; 0%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;196&nbsp; 2.5ms&nbsp; &nbsp;2.2&nbsp; &nbsp;0.4&nbsp; &nbsp;4.8&nbsp; &nbsp; 0.9&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><b>1&nbsp; 10.10.100.1&nbsp; 0%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;196&nbsp; 6ms&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5.5&nbsp; &nbsp;3.5&nbsp; &nbsp;11.7&nbsp; &nbsp;1.2&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><b>2&nbsp; 10.10.1.1&nbsp; &nbsp; 2%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;196&nbsp; 8ms&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;13.2&nbsp; 5.6&nbsp; &nbsp;50.1&nbsp; &nbsp;9.2&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><b>3&nbsp; 10.8.8.28&nbsp; &nbsp; 0%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;196&nbsp; 11.4ms&nbsp; 11.9&nbsp; 5.7&nbsp; &nbsp;50.1&nbsp; &nbsp;8.7&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><b>-- [Q quit|D dump|C-z pause]</b></font></p><div><br></div>',NULL,1),(64,'2026-09-08 03:35:52','cloud','cara whitelist ip server myrep-pabx','pagi rekan sim, bisa dibantu allow prefix berikut, CGNAT untuk IP sebelumya lg kendala\r\nini ipnya:\r\n103.47.132.0/26\r\n202.152.203.0/26\r\n\r\ncaranya di whitelist ip udp nya di server pabx myrep','<p>pilih instance cccm-Myrep_pabx, lalu masuk ke security group</p><p>lalu di security grup pilih yg MYREP</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788838151_image.png\" style=\"width: 387px;\"></p><p>setelah itu di tampilan inbound kita add rule atau copy aja, kita tambahkan ip yg di minta untuk di whitelist contoh seperti gambar di bawah ini dan untuk port range nya pilih yg 5060/5060 sama 10000 - 40000 :</p><p>jadi kitambahkan kedua ip ini di port tersebut</p><p>103.47.132.0/26</p><p>202.152.203.0/26</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788838330_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,1),(65,'2026-09-09 03:49:49','cloud','cloning server cloud','contoh cloning server cloud bcaf-va','<p>login ke web alibaba menggunakan akun email&nbsp;</p><p>note: sebelum kita hapus server, cloning os atau ganti os, kita pastikan dulu di images sudah tercreate server tersebut seperti gambar dibawah ini</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788923564_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p><p> kalo belum ada</p><p>kita bisa di create image dulu dengan masuk ke menu instance lalu pilih menu backup dan&nbsp; terus pilih create image seperti gambar di bawah ini</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788923703_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"></p><p>setelah di klik nanti muncul tampilan seperti gambar dibawah ini untuk namanya di sesuaikan aja sesuai servernya, lalu ceklis seperti gambar dibawah ini</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788923858_image.png\" style=\"width: 534px;\"><br></p><p>lalu klik confirm dan selesai</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788923966_image.png\" style=\"width: 522.984px;\"></p><p>ini hasilnya kita bisa cek lagi di image</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788924234_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>setelah sudah create image kita lanjutkan untuk proses cloning server di cloud alibaba</p><p>selanjutnya masuk ke menu instance lalu kita pilih server yang mau di cloning</p><p>saat mau cloning server dipastikan server nya di matikan dahulu dan statusnya stop seperti gambar dibawah ini</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788923191_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>masih di menu itu di bagian konfiguration kita pilih operating system lalu klik change</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788923282_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"></p><p>setelah di klik nanti muncul tampilan seperti gambar dibawah ini, disini ada 2 pilihan utuk replace sytem disk dan migrate operating system</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788924453_image.png\" style=\"width: 635.977px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>karna kita kebutuhnnya replace sytem disk maka kita pilih itu, lalu ceklis&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 249, 217); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">I am aware of the preceding risks and want to continue.&nbsp; </span>selanjutnya klik continue to replace Operating system</p><p>setelah itu akan muncul tampilan seperti di bawah ini</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788924955_image.png\" style=\"width: 718.969px;\"><br></p><p>disini tampilan dibagian public image kita bisa pilih OS dan Versi OS yang kita butuhkan.</p><p><br></p><p>lalu masih di tampilan yang sama kita scrol kebawah disini ada menu custom password , untuk keypair biarkan saja gausah diisi ikutin standartnya aja</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788925265_image.png\" style=\"width: 671.977px;\"><br></p><p>disini kita bisa isi passwordnya, kalo bingung kita bisa bukan link ini untuk generate password</p><p><a href=\"https://www.avast.com/random-password-generator#pc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.avast.com/random-password-generator#pc</a></p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788925492_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p>kalo sudah selanjutnya klik replace, jangan lupa di simpan user dan passwordnya di notepad</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788925538_image.png\" style=\"width: 700.969px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>klik replace&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1788925749_image.png\" style=\"width: 736.922px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,1),(66,'2026-09-14 04:08:22','Security','pengecekan serangan peretas dari wazuh ','pengecekan serangan peretas dari wazuh ','<p>masuk ke aplikasi wazuh&nbsp;</p><p>172.16.70.68:8642</p><p>user: admin</p><p>password:&nbsp;M6OxhxhOoYTfJj5sUouB</p><p><br></p><p>bisa kita lihat setelah kita login nanti tampilan dashboardnya ada pilihan critical serverity, high serverity, medium serverity dan low serverity dan disitu ada rangenya2 nya juga untuk tingkat keamanannnya</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1789353851_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"></p><p>yang harus selelu di perhatikan itu pada tingkat keamanan critical serverity dan high serverity setiap harinya, untuk melihatnya contoh gambar di atas ada high serverity dan jumlahnya ada 124 itu bisa kita klik saja angkatnya:</p><p><br><img src=\"uploads/1789354089_image.png\" style=\"width: 180px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>lalu selanjutnya akan memasuki tampilan seperti ini : nah misalnya ada yg aneh itu perlu kita perhatikan contoh gambar dibawah ini<br><img src=\"uploads/1789354258_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p><p>cara mencari tahunya klik saja tanda panah yang saya lingkari terus disitu ada 2 pilihan table dan json nah yang kita ambil itudata isi json nya saja terus kita bisa cari tahu ke gemini.ai mengenai masalah tersebut</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1789354836_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p><p>setelah di cari tahu berikut hasil informasi nya dari ai:<br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"0\">Berikut adalah ringkasan padat dari analisis serangan tersebut:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Jenis Serangan:</b> Eksploitasi SSRF / RCE mencoba mencuri kredensial AWS IAM (<code data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">169.254.169.254</code>) menggunakan <i data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"104\">payload</i> URL panjang (<code data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"125\">?unix:AAA...|http://...</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sumber &amp; Target:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">IP Penyerang:</b> <code data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">85.239.151.82</code> (Bulgaria)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Target Agent:</b> <code data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">wa-fif-pv</code> (<code data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\">192.168.0.6</code>)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Waktu:</b> 14 September 2026, 08:39:15 WIB</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Deteksi &amp; Status:</b> Wazuh mendeteksi level tinggi (Rule ID 31115: <i data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">URL too long</i> / Level 13), namun Nginx berhasil memblokir permintaan ini dengan status <b data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"150\">400 (Bad Request)</b> sebelum mencapai aplikasi backend.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\">selanjutnya kita kan sudah tahu ip penyerangnya berasal dari bulgaria, selanjutnya kita bisa blok aja ipnya dari security groupnya di server yang akan di retas</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\">untuk blok ini kita perlu masuk ke alibaba cloud, karna servernya ini berada di cloud,&nbsp;</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\">=========================blok ip peretas=====================</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\">masuk ke alibaba cloud</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\">selanjutnya pilih instance&nbsp;</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\">lalu pilih server yang tadi ada yang mencoba meretas yaitu server wa-fif-pv</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\">selanjutnya didalam tampilan itu kita pilih security group, lalu kita pilih CCCM-HTTPS, kenapa pilih ini karena server ini sudah dibuat publik dan sudah ada domainnya jadi pasti peretasnya ini masuk melalui publik</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\"><img src=\"uploads/1789358529_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p></li></ul><p>lalu klik cccm-https di gambar atas, seanjutnya kita masuk ke tampilan gambar di bawah, dan disitulah kita buat rule baru caranya dengan klik add rule , disini kita akan memblok all trafic dari ip peretas tesebut ikuti seperti gambar di bawah ini</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1789358842_image.png\" style=\"width: 621.984px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>dan selesai ini hasilnya</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1789358759_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p>',NULL,1),(67,'2026-09-14 10:13:10','Tugas-pagi','Pengecekan data sebelum di filter oleh center head ','Pengecekan data sebelum di filter oleh center head ','<h3>Pengecekan Data FIF Sebelum Proses Filter CH</h3><p>pukul 06:00 pagi</p><h4>1. Pengecekan Penarikan Data Scheduler</h4><ul><li><p>Pastikan proses penarikan data dari <strong>STG FIF Nasional</strong> ke <strong>STG SIM</strong> telah berhasil dan seluruh data sudah tertarik sesuai dengan email data yang dikirim oleh FIF.</p></li><li><p>Lakukan pengecekan pada database <strong>db_sim</strong> berdasarkan center yang telah ditentukan.</p><p>contoh data dan center di db sim stg_colection_task :&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1789380877_image.png\" style=\"width: 296px;\"><br></p></li><li><p>Apabila ditemukan:</p><ul><li><p>Data tidak tertarik sama sekali.</p></li><li><p>Jumlah data yang tertarik tidak sesuai dengan email FIF.</p></li></ul><p>Maka wajib dilakukan <strong>penarikan manual melalui Back End (BE) FIF Nasional</strong>.</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1789380154_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></p></li><li><p>Jika terdapat kendala saat penarikan data, seperti data kosong atau error lainnya, segera komunikasikan kepada:</p><ul><li><p>Tim FIF terkait.</p></li><li><p>Tim PKP.</p></li></ul><p>Tujuannya agar kendala dapat segera ditindaklanjuti dan proses operasional tidak terhambat.</p></li></ul><hr><h4>2. Pengecekan Data NCL</h4><ul><li><p>Lakukan pengecekan data <strong>NCL (No Call List)</strong> pada tabel <strong>STG_COLLECTION_TASK</strong> di database <strong>db_sim</strong> untuk memastikan apakah terdapat kontrak yang masuk ke daftar NCL.Apabila ditemukan data NCL, lakukan proses <strong>sync NCL</strong> melalui menu <strong>Upload</strong> pada <strong>BE FIF</strong> hingga data berhasil ter-update dan akan masuk ke stg_colection_result.</p><p>Apabila ditemukan data NCL, lakukan proses <strong>Sync NCL</strong> melalui menu <strong>Upload</strong> pada <strong>BE FIF</strong>. Pastikan proses sync berhasil hingga seluruh data NCL ter-update dan masuk ke tabel <strong>STG_COLLECTION_RESULT</strong> sebagai tanda bahwa proses sinkronisasi telah berhasil dilakukan.</p><p>berikut tampilan BE SYCN NCL DI 30.33</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1789380632_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></p></li></ul><hr><h4>3. Pengecekan MPP</h4><p>Sebelum proses filter dilakukan, pastikan jumlah MPP sesuai dengan ketentuan berikut:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Hari</th><th>MPP</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Senin – Jumat</td><td>225</td></tr><tr><td>Sabtu</td><td>180</td></tr><tr><td>Minggu</td><td>225</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li><p>Khusus hari Sabtu, pastikan MPP yang digunakan adalah <strong>180</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Untuk hari Minggu, lakukan pengecekan agar MPP tetap sesuai ketentuan yaitu <strong>225</strong>.</p></li></ul><hr><h4>4. Pengecekan Data Khusus</h4><p>Lakukan pengecekan terhadap data yang berpotensi menyebabkan kendala saat proses upload maupun dialing, antara lain:</p><ul><li><p>Nomor telepon yang mengandung karakter khusus.</p></li><li><p>Alamat yang mengandung karakter khusus.</p></li><li><p>Data tidak lengkap atau format data yang tidak sesuai standar.</p></li></ul><hr><h4>5. Validasi Akhir</h4><ul><li><p>Setelah seluruh pengecekan selesai dan dipastikan:</p><ul><li><p>Data yang tertarik sudah sesuai dengan email FIF.</p></li><li><p>pastikan jika terdapat ncl sudah terscyn dengan baik dan sudah masuk ke stg result&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>MPP sudah sesuai ketentuan.</p></li><li><p>Tidak terdapat karakter khusus yang bermasalah.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>Maka data dinyatakan <strong>siap diproses dan dapat dilanjutkan ke tahap filter / di bagikan ke center center oleh tim CH.&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>untuk selanjut pengecekan data affter filter nya,</strong></p>',NULL,1),(68,'2026-09-16 02:22:43','Jaringan','routing api my rep api-myrep.simgroup.co.id','routing api my rep api-myrep.simgroup.co.id\r\n\r\nhttps://api-myrep.simgroup.co.id/cti/monitor/monitor.html','<p>api-myrep.simgroup.co.id</p><p><br></p><p>routing api my rep api-myrep.simgroup.co.id</p><p><br></p><p>[angga@ROUTER KR3] > tool/traceroute api-myrep.simgroup.co.id</p><p>Columns: ADDRESS, LOSS, SENT, LAST, AVG, BEST, WORST, STD-DEV</p><p>#  ADDRESS          LOSS  SENT  LAST     AVG   BEST  WORST  STD-DEV</p><p>0  103.165.198.81   0%      30  0.1ms    0.1   0.1   0.1    0      </p><p>1  100.70.60.125    0%      30  1ms      1.4   0.8   9.7    1.6    </p><p>2  103.182.182.210  0%      30  2.3ms    2.9   2.1   11.2   1.9    </p><p>3  103.182.182.209  0%      30  1.8ms    1.8   1.7   1.8    0      </p><p>4  103.182.182.186  0%      30  2.7ms    2.4   2.1   3.6    0.3    </p><p>5  103.182.182.250  0%      30  3.5ms    7.2   3.3   110.9  19.3   </p><p>6                   100%    30  timeout                            </p><p>7                   100%    29  timeout                            </p><p>8                   100%    29  timeout                            </p><p>9  8.215.24.151     0%      29  50.2ms   50.3  50.2  50.3   0 </p>',NULL,1),(69,'2026-09-17 03:41:58','cloud','perpanjang ssl fif dasahboard (dashboard-fif-dc.simgroup.co.id)','perpanjang ssl fif dasahboard (dashboard-fif-dc.simgroup.co.id)','<p>pertama buka server fif dashboardnya</p><p>ip fif dashboard : 192.168.0.130</p><p>setelah masuk ssh nya jalankan ini:</p><p>certbot certonly --manual --preferred-challenges dns -d dashboard-fif-dc.simgroup.co.id</p><div>nanti akan muncul hasilnya seperti di bawah ini:</div><div><br></div><div><div><img src=\"uploads/1789615758_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>bTF3v_iwXDTnxYJAMqqCvdAKlEAUbn7y96K0ksnQQNo --&gt; ini yang kita ambil</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</div><div>Press Enter to Continue</div><div><br></div><div>setelah disini jangan di enter dulu yaa</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>fungsi kode ini \"bTF3v_iwXDTnxYJAMqqCvdAKlEAUbn7y96K0ksnQQNo\" untuk kita masukan di cloudflare</div><div><br></div><div>sekarang kita masuk ke web cloudflare&nbsp; lalu kita cari nama domainnya di cloudflare tersebut</div><div><br></div><div>dashboard-fif-dc.simgroup.co.id</div><div><br></div><div>contoh seperti gambar di bawah ini:</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"uploads/1789615544_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>nah disitu kita edit yang saya lingkari, lalu masukan kode yang kita dapatkan \"bTF3v_iwXDTnxYJAMqqCvdAKlEAUbn7y96K0ksnQQNo\"&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>setelah itu kita kembali lagi ke ssh dan lalu kita enter sampai muncul successfully</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"uploads/1789615695_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>selanjutnya ambil privkey.pem dan fullchain.pem</div><div><br></div><div>lokasinya ada disini:</div><div><div>Certificate is saved at:&nbsp; &nbsp;/etc/letsencrypt/live/dashboard-fif-dc.simgroup.co.id/fullchain.pem</div><div>Key is saved at&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; :&nbsp; /etc/letsencrypt/live/dashboard-fif-dc.simgroup.co.id/privkey.pem</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>nah selanjutnya kita upload ke waf di alibabacloud:</div><div><br></div><div>login ke akun alibaba lalu masuk ke link ini aja</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://yundun.console.alibabacloud.com/?p=wafnew&amp;spm=5176.2020520163.console-base_search-panel.dtab-product_waf.23434Xbs4Xbshf#/access/cname/global\" target=\"_blank\">https://yundun.console.alibabacloud.com/?p=wafnew&amp;spm=5176.2020520163.console-base_search-panel.dtab-product_waf.23434Xbs4Xbshf#/access/cname/global</a></div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"uploads/1789616016_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>disini kita pilih domain nya lalu kita klik edit aja</div><div><br></div><div>nah di bagian configure listener kita bisa masukan file privkey.pem dan fullchain.pem</div><div><img src=\"uploads/1789616185_image.png\" style=\"width: 669.961px;\"><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div>dibagian ini scrole aja ke bawah sampai menemukan ini Edit Domain Name disini kita pilih yg upload</div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"uploads/1789616357_image.png\" style=\"width: 672px;\"><br></div><div><br></div><div>lalu upload dibagian certificat file itu file yg di upload fullchain.pem dan untuk privatkey filenya yang ini privkey.pem oke setelah itu save aja</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>done selesai</div>',NULL,1),(70,'2026-09-17 09:03:08','Server','routingan dari server myrep langsung ke myrep client','routingan dari server langsung ke myrep','<p><img src=\"uploads/1789635744_image.png\" style=\"width: 520.969px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p>-bash-4.2$ route</p><p>Kernel IP routing table</p><p>Destination&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Gateway&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Genmask&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Flags Metric Ref&nbsp; &nbsp; Use Iface</p><p>default&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;gateway&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;0.0.0.0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;UG&nbsp; &nbsp; 100&nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0 eth0</p><p>10.10.90.1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0.0.0.0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;255.255.255.255 UH&nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0 ppp0</p><p>host-103-47-132 gateway&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;255.255.255.255 UGH&nbsp; &nbsp;0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0 eth0</p><p>82.198.165.103. gateway&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;255.255.255.255 UGH&nbsp; &nbsp;0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0 eth0</p><p>172.16.30.0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;10.10.90.1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 255.255.255.0&nbsp; &nbsp;UG&nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0 ppp0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>172.17.52.0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;192.168.245.1&nbsp; &nbsp;255.255.255.0&nbsp; &nbsp;UG&nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0 ppp1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>192.168.0.0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;0.0.0.0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;255.255.255.0&nbsp; &nbsp;U&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;100&nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0 eth0</p><p>192.168.245.1&nbsp; &nbsp;0.0.0.0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;255.255.255.255 UH&nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 0 ppp1</p><p>-bash-4.2$</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"uploads/1789635819_image.png\" style=\"width: 661.969px;\"><br></p><div><br></div>',NULL,1),(71,'2026-09-22 03:30:37','Database','already','agen gabisa login','<p>&nbsp;update tbluser set flag =\'N\' where username =\'PEG210989\'</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790047824_image.png\" style=\"width: 810.016px;\"><br></p>',NULL,2),(72,'2026-09-22 06:42:31','Database','unrelease','agen gabisa release','<p>querynya apa </p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790059338_image.png\" style=\"width: 231.984px;\"><br></p>',NULL,2),(73,'2026-09-22 07:22:43','Database','KERJAAN PAGI','kerjaan pagi ','<p>1. TEST PING FI PV DI SSH ( report di wa SIM PV)<br>IP 192.168.0.215<br></p><p>&nbsp;PING 104.18.7.51<br><img src=\"uploads/1790061082_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></p><p>2. TEST PING MYREP ( report di wa it support )<br>IP : 192.168.0.191<br>buka sshnya lalu ketik&nbsp; /menu.sh klik enter + pilih 2<br><img src=\"uploads/1790061113_image.png\" style=\"width: 503px;\"><br></p><p>3. CEK MTF CS ( report di it support)</p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></span><a href=\"https://mtf.onebox.co.id/Login\" target=\"_blank\">https://mtf.onebox.co.id/Login</a><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>https://icaremtf.mtf.co.id:1212/ICare/ICareLogin&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span></span><a href=\"http://172.24.42.4/estartunas/am_login\" target=\"_blank\">http://172.24.42.4/estartunas/am_login</a><a href=\"http://172.24.42.4/estartunas/am_login\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br><img src=\"uploads/1790061156_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br><a href=\"http://172.24.42.4/estartunas/am_login\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><p>4. cek grafana data dan cdr sudah termove to last ( report di group wa RTC STC)<br><a href=\"http://172.16.30.30:3000\" target=\"_blank\">http://172.16.30.30:3000</a><a href=\"http://172.16.30.30:3000\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br><img src=\"uploads/1790061259_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></p><p>5. test call melalui msip setiap client dan cek di grafana terbentuk gak&nbsp; dan report juga di RTC STC<br><img src=\"uploads/1790061275_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br></span></p><p>6. cek data Sehati, MTF SKIPTRACE, MTF REGULER, DAN BCAF&nbsp;<br>http://172.16.70.20/sd/RTC-STC-ALL-KRANGGAN.php<br><img src=\"uploads/1790061341_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></p><div>7. tarik data , tapi tunggu di filter dahulu di group helpdesk dan tunggu aba aba di telegram, data bisa ditarik<br><img src=\"uploads/1790061424_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></div><p><br><img src=\"uploads/1790061444_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"></p><p>8. setelah ada info aba aba data bisa ditarik , silahkan di tarik melalui link tersebut (JANGAN LUPA DI UBAH TANGGAL- BULAN DAN TAHUN)<br></p><p>INI BUAT NARIK DATA MANUAL</p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">*&nbsp; tarik data FIF DC (GANTI TANGGAL)&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href=\"http://172.16.31.11/C_Ws_Collection_Task?created=2026-09-17&amp;coy=00024\" target=\"_blank\">http://172.16.31.11/C_Ws_Collection_Task?created=2026-09-17&amp;coy=00024</a>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">info di group ops -it center swadaya</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre; white-space: normal;\">		</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">* TARIK DATA AMITRA : (GANTI TANGGAL)</span></p><p><a href=\"http://172.16.70.3:5121/C_Ws_Collection_Task?coy=00061&amp;created=2026-09-17\" target=\"_blank\">http://172.16.70.3:5121/C_Ws_Collection_Task?coy=00061&amp;created=2026-09-17</a></p><p>* TARIK DATA FIF HYBRID</p><p><a href=\"http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_run_ws_autodial\" target=\"_blank\">http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_run_ws_autodial</a></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">info di info di group ops -it center swadaya</p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre; white-space: normal;\">	</span></p><p>9. Share data di tarik melalui data base ke group ops wa<br><br>10. finalin data melalui exel dan di report di group helpdesk dan support fif dc<br><img src=\"uploads/1790061673_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br><img src=\"uploads/1790061692_image.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></p>',NULL,2),(81,'2026-09-23 04:37:11','Database','KERJAAN SORE','untuk mengirim data hari ini dari STG SIM ke STG FIF','<p>kerjaan sore<br>18.00-----------------------------------------------------------------<br>kirim failed<br><br>18.30-----------------------------------------------------------------<br>Cek sms project pada DB NAS 30.34 sudah terkirim semua <br>atau belum untuk memastikan sudah sinkron.<br><br>Buka link http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_home<br>Configuration > WS Update SMS > UPDATE RESULT SMS PROJECT > Sync > Insert > M to N<br><br>cek lagi pada db_sim dan pastikan data sudah sesuai.<br><br>buka moba xterm 30.33 <br>node /var/www/html/node_wssms/app_sendresult.js<br>enter<br><br>tunggu n berubah jadi y semua<br><br>*SMS Project DONE* sudah terkirim ke stagg FIF<br>Data sudah sesuai dengan jumlah *2.401*<br>Terimakasih<br><br>cleansing token sms project<br>http://172.16.30.33:6123/token/get_token <br><br>19.00-------------------------------------------------------------------<br>Menunggu last call dari grup OPS - IT Center Swadaya<br><br>Cek result pada db fifdc dan amitra<br>dan pastikan aman sesuai<br><br>buka back end 30.33<br>ws get task & result <br>configuration > get task result > pilih center<br>kranggan > auto dial bali result> run<br>kranggan3c1 > result > run<br><br>KIRIM DATA FIF DC<br>    https://172.16.31.11/c_ws_collection_result?created=2026-08-27&coy=00024&type=1 <br><br>data amitra  <br>    http://172.16.70.3:5121/C_Ws_Collection_Result?created=2026-08-27&coy=00061&type=1<br>    <br>data FIF HYBRID<br>    http://192.168.0.2/C_Ws_Collection_Result?created=2026-08-27&coy=00028&type=1<br>    <br>jika ada data manual, cek result di rev_eng<br><br>cek di db sim 30.34<br><br>cek di db sim manual jika ada, pake query flag<br><br>SETELAH DICEK, CATAT M N FLAG DI REPORT SORE<br><br>get data sms<br>https://172.16.31.11/<br>SD-KRA<br>Sd-kra3*<br>GET DATA > GET PROVIDER > GET VENDOR > GET FLAG > EXECUTE<br><br>setelah di get, lanjut cek pada db sms test<br><br>kirim sms ke 30.33<br><br>1 = beyond<br>3 = pkp<br><br>get utc TO msg3 masih spert biasa http://172.16.30.33:1221/<br>(note jika mau m TO N pastiin semua center udah terkirim ke stagging)<br><br>buka link http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_home<br>configuration > WS UPDATE SMS > UPDATE RESULT SMS BEFORE CALL<br><br>sebelum dikirim ke fif, cek parameter dan pastikan tidak ada double kontrak<br><br>Jika aman,langsung kirim ke stagging FIF : <br>    <br>node /var/www/html/node_wsfif/dc_sendresult.js (SERVER 30.33)<br>    <br>cek data apabila ada yg X, di sesuaikan hingga tidak ada lg X<br><br>setelah x sudah tidak ada, <br><br>kirim report ke telegram<br><br>kirim ke wa helpdesk juga<br><br>*Data system DONE* sudah terkirim ke Stagging FIF <br>total *30.489* dan blankphone kontrak total 0<br>jumlah sudah sesuai dengan yang diterima ke stagging SIM.... Terimakasih<br><br>lalu ss http://172.16.30.30:666/d/tAfk5annk/dashboard-sms?orgId=1<br>SMS DC, DATA FIF ,NON DC DAN SMS PROJECT SUKSES TERKIRIM KE STG FIF<br><br>SMS DC (WA Blast), DATA FIF, NON DC DAN SMS PROJECT SUKSES TERKIRIM KE STG FIF<br><br>SMS DC (WA Blast), DATA FIF, NON DC (0) DAN SMS PROJECT SUKSES TERKIRIM KE STG FIF<br><br>SMS DC(0), DATA FIF ,NON DC (0) DAN SMS PROJECT SUKSES TERKIRIM KE STG FIF<br><br>DATA FIF, NON DC (WA Blast), DAN SMS PROJECT SUKSES TERKIRIM KE STG FIF<br><br>kirim ke grup IT Support WA<br><br>ss MUF di grafana untuk anomali call durasi yang 4 digit<br>hari ini sampe jam LC terpantau aman mas @Mas Yudha SIM  blm ada yg 4 digit<br><br>hari ini sampe jam LC terpantau utnuk MUF telesales mas @Mas Yudha SIM  ada yg 4 digit untuk durasinya mas yud<br></p><p>SS laporan pada DB NAS 30.34<br>*Data Sms NONDC done sudah terkirim ke stagging FIF,sesuai dengan data FINAL dengan total 8*<br><br>*Data Sms PROJECT done sudah terkirim ke stagging FIF,sesuai dengan data FINAL dengan total 2.401*<br></p><p>SS laporan WA BLAST di DB WA BLAST<br>*27/08/2026*<br>*WA_Blast Sukses terkirim 6.098 Gagal 159*<br>*(done Email,NONDC & PROJECT sudah sesuai datanya dengan Total rincian 6.257*<br><br>19.00-----------------------------------<br>kirim sehati<br>    172.16.70.16:2102/ws_shst/c_send_result/sendresult<br>    http://172.16.70.20/sd/RTC-STC-ALL-KRANGGAN.php<br>kirim success fee<br><br>SS hasil teleremedia di RTC STC KRANGGAN</p><p>Share data di grup Teleremedial Spc Bucket di db success fee<br>    <br>bila data teleremedial kosong coba jalankan ini, bila hasilnya gagal ss dan lapor digrup teleremedial<br>    <br>172.16.30.47:4997/Result/send_contacted<br>    <br>20.00-----------------------------------<br>ping ftp muf<br>ping 10.86.60.81<br><br>status ping FTP MUF terpantau aman<br><br>ss di tele applikasi untuk pengiriman data MUF<br><br>bila tidak terupdate maka jalankan ini pada ssh MUF<br>sudo /bin/bash /root/cronjob/cronjob.daily.sendresult2.sh<br><br>Generate MUF reguler dan MUF DC od60 upload sudah berhasil, terima kasih🙏<br>20.30---------------------------------<br>http://172.16.30.25:500/c_wa_blast<br>MTF done send to STG ya mas @Mas Yudha SIM statusnya succes<br><br><br>Data MTF sudah terkirim ke core MTF terima kasih🙏<br>20.30---------------------------------<br>Cek link http://192.168.0.215:9000/c_home<br><br>Status FIF PV After LC aman terimakasih🙏<br><br>ss kirim ke grup aplikasi<br><br>ubah tabel parameter mpp di db nas > prod5 > tbl parameter<br>jumat malam jadi 180<br>sabtu malam jadi 225<br></p><p>^ PARAMETER MPP sudah dirubah menjadi 225<br><br><br></p>','uploads/kerjaan sore.txt',2),(82,'2026-09-24 07:43:22','Database','META FAILED','alur proses pengiriman meta failed after SMS PROJECT Phone 2 selesai kirim','<p>1. ambil kontrak DATA Wa failed jika sms project sudah terflag Y semua,seblum dijalanin querynya koordinais sama denny dulu ya<br><br>-- Ambil data failed NON DC dan SMS Project<br>SELECT DISTINCT wa_data.param1<br>FROM wa_data<br>LEFT JOIN wa_bulk_dr<br>ON wa_data.wa_id = wa_bulk_dr.messageid<br>WHERE DATE(wa_data.created_timestamp) = CURDATE()&nbsp;<br>AND wa_data.template_name in(\'script_wa_project\')<br>AND (<br>(wa_data.source_sms = \'SMS PROJECT\'<br>AND TIME(wa_data.created_timestamp) &gt;= \'18:00:00\'<br>)<br>OR<br>(wa_data.source_sms = \'SMS NON DC\'<br>AND TIME(wa_data.created_timestamp) &gt;= \'08:00:00\'<br>))<br>AND (<br>wa_bulk_dr.status = \'failed\' OR wa_data.delivery_status = \'failed\'<br>);<br><br></p><p>2. get sms project kaya biasa ngrim sms pagi sampai tombol button terakhir<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_smsproject<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_setup_data_sms<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;<br>3. hapus DATA di tabel sms yg ga ada di dalem excel itu kontraknya db_sms_test<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;<br>DELETE FROM sms_data WHERE noKontrak NOT IN(&nbsp;<br>\'733000781426\',<br>\'733000248326\',<br>\'706000150826\',<br>\'701000779025\',<br>\'706001748125\',<br>\'712002214224\',<br>\'712000229526\',<br>\'706000307226\',<br>\'701001518123\',<br>\'733000995926\',<br>\'706001180926\',<br>\'701001019726\',<br>\'701000303926\',<br>\'706000226326\',<br>\'208001886525\',<br>\'103001972825\',<br>\'126001342125\',<br>\'157000193925\',<br>\'126004043325\',<br>\'126005326526\',<br>\'145000408625\',<br>\'102001261126\',<br>\'102000142226\',<br>\'159001279725\',<br>\'143002993825\',<br>\'143000603426\',<br>\'143000376626\',<br>\'143001836525\',<br>\'163002976625\',<br>\'125900040924\',<br>\'145000503325\',<br>\'119000537325\',<br>\'119004304024\',<br>\'248001127424\',<br>\'250003088725\',<br>\'248000201526\',<br>\'252002268425\',<br>\'252001098325\',<br>\'252900047223\',<br>\'977001194325\',<br>\'977002649624\',<br>\'405900053726\',<br>\'405000067625\',<br>\'405900140626\',<br>\'402900440125\',<br>\'278900128325\',<br>\'402001396224\',<br>\'252000207525\',<br>\'250001224126\',<br>\'507808612026\',<br>\'280000324825\',<br>\'418000974423\',<br>\'280003159324\',<br>\'415001222924\',<br>\'250000981626\',<br>\'250000365726\',<br>\'216001082024\',<br>\'41800186