'116001979025\',<br>\'104902067424\',<br>\'205001189426\',<br>\'205000216925\',<br>\'126003998525\',<br>\'126002539325\',<br>\'143003467924\',<br>\'219001533125\',<br>\'146000216725\',<br>\'224002146325\',<br>\'209001124325\',<br>\'207000323926\',<br>\'119000335025\',<br>\'231000574325\',<br>\'102000841826\',<br>\'156003028025\',<br>\'105000623325\',<br>\'227001038926\',<br>\'146002334624\',<br>\'224001322925\',<br>\'235000403925\',<br>\'202001205925\',<br>\'234001079924\',<br>\'203000230825\',<br>\'163902309225\',<br>\'163901135625\',<br>\'203000148125\',<br>\'146002477224\',<br>\'231000627225\',<br>\'217000411025\',<br>\'301001745925\',<br>\'219002469724\',<br>\'219000733925\',<br>\'231001151724\',<br>\'226901240225\',<br>\'203001664224\',<br>\'229000805724\',<br>\'209002858724\',<br>\'216901344325\',<br>\'257900854426\',<br>\'418002030525\',<br>\'215000331625\',<br>\'254901128425\',<br>\'302000064325\',<br>\'247002455124\',<br>\'247000916325\',<br>\'248000546925\',<br>\'248000193225\',<br>\'313902067825\',<br>\'252003579024\',<br>\'402000332425\',<br>\'402000877325\',<br>\'216001704924\',<br>\'304002625025\',<br>\'231900156325\',<br>\'304003971525\',<br>\'422000497825\',<br>\'261002719924\',<br>\'415001593025\',<br>\'265000596725\',<br>\'265002265925\',<br>\'304000128525\',<br>\'247000384825\',<br>\'356901119525\',<br>\'402000299926\',<br>\'402000355426\',<br>\'261002155424\',<br>\'167900414225\',<br>\'216000287325\',<br>\'281002505124\',<br>\'505901040425\',<br>\'424000017326\',<br>\'281005696626\',<br>\'271004456325\',<br>\'421001265724\',<br>\'421000964124\',<br>\'240000798524\',<br>\'317903399526\',<br>\'510000556726\',<br>\'506000646023\',<br>\'405000192626\',<br>\'425000151925\',<br>\'504000092425\',<br>\'504000114425\',<br>\'506901200425\',<br>\'402000877325\',<br>\'414000568225\',<br>\'426000124626\',<br>\'216000287325\',<br>\'304003971525\',<br>\'142005502926\',<br>\'276003077124\',<br>\'422000497825\',<br>\'141002491325\',<br>\'406000955924\',<br>\'229000805724\',<br>\'110902131825\',<br>\'265002265925\',<br>\'844000140525\',<br>\'805003847126\',<br>\'805002722525\',<br>\'414001667525\',<br>\'421000964124\',<br>\'202001205925\',<br>\'551003157126\',<br>\'108000175426\',<br>\'103002530425\',<br>\'163902309225\',<br>\'402000299926\',<br>\'163901135625\',<br>\'425000151925\',<br>\'439000242626\',<br>\'408903500226\',<br>\'313902067825\',<br>\'217000411025\'<br>)<br></p><p>4. lalu jalankan kirim meta failed seperti biasa</p><p>5. setelah selesai kirim meta failed, lakukan update sms project sore dan non dc untuk pengiriman data dilink berikut: <a href=\"http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_ws_sms\" target=\"_blank\">http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_ws_sms</a> jalan kan yang UPDATE SMS PROJECT YANG WARNA MERAH DAN UPDATE RESULT SMS BEFORE CALL WARNA BIRU SAJA!!!</p><p>6. SETELAH GENERATE DAN UPDATE, lakukan generate result  wa project ke stg_coll_result_sms pada link berikut: <a href=\"http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_ws_whatsapp\" target=\"_blank\">http://172.16.30.33:3108/c_ws_whatsapp</a> <br>klik: SYNC DATA WHATSAPP --> GENERATE REPORT --> SYNC DATA WHATSAPP NON DC --> GENERATE REPORT NON DC</p><p>7. KIRIM SMS PROJECT SORE PASTIKAN TOTAL SESUAI DENGAN FINALAN PAGI HARI, </p><p>#BILA ADA PERBEDAAN LAKUKAN DULU INSERT SORE!!!</p><p>8. LAPORKAN AFTER PENGIRIMAN SMS PROJECT KE GRUP HELPDESK</p><p>9. CEK SEMUA DATA SEBELUM KIRIM DARI STATUS FLAG --> PARAMETER --> DOUBLE KONTRAK --> BLANKPHONE <br>#INGAT PASTIKAN SELALU DATA SESUAI DENGAN TOTAL FINALAN PAGI HARI TIDAK ADA DOUBLE KONTRAK ATAUPUN BILA TIDAK SESUAI NAMUN TIDAK ADA DOUBLE KONTRAK CEK BLANKPHONENYA</p><p>10. KIRIM DATA ALL PASTIKAN JUMLAHNYA SESUAI DENGAN FINALAN PAGI HARI</p><p>11. KIRIM REPORT SEPERTI BIASA DI GRUP HELPDESK SETELAH SELESAI KIRIM DATA DISERTAKAN SSNYA SUDAH Y SEMUA </p><p>12. BUAT REPORT UNTUK LAPORAN DITELEGRAM DISERTAI SS SEPERTI KIRIM DATA BIASANYA<br># UNTUK REPORT SUDAH TERSEDIA SILAHKAN CEK DI SOLUSI DENGAN JUDUL REPORT SORE FIF LIBUR</p><p><br></p><p><br><br><br><br><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,2),(90,'2026-09-28 06:57:58','Aplikasi','crack microsoft office','aktivasi office','<p><a href=\"https://www.bagitekno.net/office/cara-aktivasi-office-2019.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.bagitekno.net/office/cara-aktivasi-office-2019.html</a><a href=\"https://www.bagitekno.net/office/cara-aktivasi-office-2019.html\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><p><br></p><p>ada 2 cara :</p><p><br></p><p>1. buka cmd lalu jalankan ini<br>curl -L keyms.id/ao2019 -o ao2019.cmd &amp; ao2019.cmd</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>2. buat script bat dengan text di bawah ini:<br><br><br></p><pre style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\">@echo off\r\ntitle Aktivasi Microsoft Office 2019 Tanpa Software - BagiTekno&amp;cls&amp;(net session &gt;nul 2&gt;&amp;1)\r\nif %errorLevel% GTR 0 (echo.&amp;echo Aktivasi tidak bisa dilanjut, Anda harus Run CMD as administrator...&amp;echo.&amp;goto halt)\r\necho =====================================================================================&amp;echo #Project: Aktivasi Microsoft Office 2019 Tanpa Software&amp;echo =====================================================================================&amp;echo.&amp;echo #Supported products:&amp;echo - Microsoft Office Standard 2019&amp;echo - Microsoft Office Professional Plus 2019&amp;echo.&amp;echo.&amp;echo Memulai proses aktivasi, silahkan tunggu...&amp;echo.&amp;(if exist \"%ProgramFiles%\\Microsoft Office\\Office16\\ospp.vbs\" (cd /d \"%ProgramFiles%\\Microsoft Office\\Office16\") else if exist \"%ProgramFiles(x86)%\\Microsoft Office\\Office16\\ospp.vbs\" (cd /d \"%ProgramFiles(x86)%\\Microsoft Office\\Office16\") else if exist \"%ProgramFiles%\\Microsoft Office\\root\\Office16\\ospp.vbs\" (cd /d \"%ProgramFiles%\\Microsoft Office\"&amp;mkdir Office16© /Y root\\Office16\\ospp.vbs Office16 &gt;nul&amp;cd Office16) else if exist \"%ProgramFiles(x86)%\\Microsoft Office\\root\\Office16\\ospp.vbs\" (cd /d \"%ProgramFiles(x86)%\\Microsoft Office\"&amp;mkdir Office16© /Y root\\Office16\\ospp.vbs Office16 &gt;nul&amp;cd Office16) else (goto notsupported))&amp;tasklist /FI \"IMAGENAME eq WINWORD.EXE\" 2&gt;NUL | find /I /N \"WINWORD.EXE\"&gt;NUL &amp;&amp; taskkill /F /IM WINWORD.EXE &gt;nul&amp;tasklist /FI \"IMAGENAME eq EXCEL.EXE\" 2&gt;NUL | find /I /N \"EXCEL.EXE\"&gt;NUL &amp;&amp; taskkill /F /IM EXCEL.EXE &gt;nul&amp;tasklist /FI \"IMAGENAME eq POWERPNT.EXE\" 2&gt;NUL | find /I /N \"POWERPNT.EXE\"&gt;NUL &amp;&amp; taskkill /F /IM POWERPNT.EXE &gt;nul&amp;(REG DELETE \"HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Office\\16.0\\Common\\Licensing\" /f &gt;nul 2&gt;NUL)&amp;(cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /setprt:1688 &gt;nul || goto wshdisabled)&amp;(for /f %%x in (\'dir /b ..\\root\\Licenses16\\ProPlus2019VL*.xrm-ms\') do cscript ospp.vbs /inslic:\"..\\root\\Licenses16\\%%x\" &gt;nul)&amp;(for /f %%x in (\'dir /b ..\\root\\Licenses16\\ProPlus2019VL*.xrm-ms\') do cscript ospp.vbs /inslic:\"..\\root\\Licenses16\\%%x\" &gt;nul)&amp;cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /unpkey:WFG99 &gt;nul&amp;cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /unpkey:6MWKP &gt;nul&amp;cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /unpkey:6F7TH &gt;nul\r\n:ucpkey\r\ncscript //nologo ospp.vbs /dstatus | find /i \"Last 5 characters of installed product key\" &gt; temp.txt || goto skunpkey\r\nset /P bpkey= &lt; temp.txt\r\nset pkeyt=%bpkey:~-5%\r\necho.&amp;cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /unpkey:%pkeyt% &gt;nul&amp;goto ucpkey\r\n:skunpkey\r\necho.&amp;echo =====================================================================================&amp;echo Mengaktivasi Office 2019 anda, silahkan tunggu...&amp;echo =====================================================================================&amp;cscript //nologo slmgr.vbs /ckms &gt;nul&amp;cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /setprt:1688 &gt;nul&amp;set i=1&amp;cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /inpkey:NMMKJ-6RK4F-KMJVX-8D9MJ-6MWKP &gt;nul||goto notsupported\r\n:server\r\nif %i% GTR 8 (goto busy) else if %i% LEQ 5 (set KMS=s1.mshost.pro) else if %i% LEQ 8 (set KMS=e8.us.to)\r\ncscript //nologo ospp.vbs /sethst:%KMS% &gt;nul\r\n:ato\r\necho.&amp;echo =====================================================================================&amp;cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /act &gt;nul&amp;timeout /t 5 &gt;nul&amp;echo.&amp;cscript //nologo ospp.vbs /act | find /i \"successful\" &amp;&amp; (echo.&amp;echo =====================================================================================&amp;echo.&amp;echo.&amp;echo Dukung kami dengan donasi via saweria.co/bagitechno agar cara ini bisa terus digunakan.&amp;echo.&amp; if errorlevel 2 exit) || (echo Sepertinya butuh waktu lebih, silahkan tunggu... &amp; echo. &amp; echo. &amp; set /a i+=1 &amp; timeout /t 10 &gt;nul &amp; goto server)&amp;timeout /t 7 &gt;nul&amp;explorer \"https://saweria.co/bagitechno\"&amp;echo.&amp;echo Jika sudah donasi dan Office masih bermasalah, chat via Instagram @bagitekno_net&amp;echo.&amp;goto halt\r\n:notsupported\r\necho.&amp;echo =====================================================================================&amp;echo Maaf, Office 2019 anda tidak support.&amp;echo.&amp;goto halt\r\n:wshdisabled\r\necho =====================================================================================&amp;echo.&amp;echo Maaf, aktivasi gagal karena Windows Script Host access is disabled.&amp;echo.&amp;echo Solusinya, ikuti panduan pada video tutorial yang terbuka untuk mengizinkan Windows Script.&amp;echo.&amp;timeout /t 7 &gt;nul&amp;explorer \"https://bit.ly/3OnOdLz\"&amp;goto halt\r\n:busy\r\necho =====================================================================================&amp;echo.&amp;echo.&amp;echo Maaf, aktivasi gagal karena koneksi internet anda tidak stabil.&amp;echo.&amp;echo Silahkan sambungkan Laptop anda ke WiFi lain kemudian ulangi lagi cara ini.&amp;echo.&amp;goto halt\r\n:halt\r\ncd %~dp0&amp;del %0 &gt;nul&amp;pause &gt;nul</pre><p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></p><p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\">jika sudah di buka aja / run as administrator</p>',NULL,1),(91,'2026-10-01 02:04:45','Server','cara membuat akun ftp baru di server ftp kranggan','cara membuat akun ftp baru di server ftp kranggan','<p>&nbsp;Contoh lengkap untuk membuat user FTP baru bernama angga.</p><p>&nbsp;Jalankan sebagai root.</p><p>&nbsp;### 1. Buat user angga</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>useradd -m -d /home/angga -s /sbin/nologin angga</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;### 2. Buat password FTP</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>passwd angga</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;Masukkan password baru dua kali.</p><p>&nbsp;### 3. Buat folder IN dan OUT</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>mkdir -p /home/angga/IN</p><p>mkdir -p /home/angga/OUT</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;### 4. Atur owner dan permission</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>chown angga:angga /home/angga</p><p>chown angga:angga /home/angga/IN</p><p>chown angga:angga /home/angga/OUT</p><p><br></p><p>chmod 755 /home/angga</p><p>chmod 750 /home/angga/IN</p><p>chmod 750 /home/angga/OUT</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;### 5. Pastikan konfigurasi utama vsftpd memiliki ini</p><p>&nbsp;Edit:</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>vim /etc/vsftpd/vsftpd.conf</p><p>&nbsp;```</p><p>&nbsp;Pastikan ada:</p><p>&nbsp;```ini</p><p>anonymous_enable=NO</p><p>local_enable=YES</p><p>write_enable=YES</p><p>userlist_enable=YES</p><p>user_config_dir=/etc/vsftpd/user_conf</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;Buat directory konfigurasi user:</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>mkdir -p /etc/vsftpd/user_conf</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;### 6. Buat konfigurasi khusus user angga</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>cat &gt; /etc/vsftpd/user_conf/angga &lt;&lt;\'EOF\'</p><p>local_root=/home/angga</p><p>chroot_local_user=YES</p><p>allow_writeable_chroot=YES</p><p>EOF</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;### 7. Pastikan angga tidak diblokir FTP</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>grep -n \'^angga$\' /etc/vsftpd/user_list /etc/vsftpd/ftpusers</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;Kalau tidak ada output, berarti tidak diblokir.</p><p>&nbsp;### 8. Restart FTP</p><p>&nbsp;```bash</p><p>systemctl restart vsftpd</p><p>systemctl is-active vsftpd</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;Expected:</p><p>&nbsp;```text</p><p>active</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;### 9. Login dari aplikasi FTP</p><p>&nbsp;```text</p><p>Host&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: 172.16.70.135</p><p>Port&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: 21</p><p>Username : angga</p><p>Password : password yang dibuat saat passwd angga</p><p>Mode&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: Explicit FTP over TLS / FTPS</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;Setelah login, user angga hanya melihat:</p><p>&nbsp;```text</p><p>/</p><p>├── IN</p><p>└── OUT</p><p>&nbsp;```</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;User angga tidak bisa SSH karena shell-nya /sbin/nologin, dan tidak bisa membuka directory root server karena konfigurasi chroot khusus user tersebut.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>',NULL,1),(92,'2026-10-01 02:29:45','Jaringan','kendala isp iforte layanan cloud di alihin ke tachyon','kendala isp iforte layanan cloud di alihin ke tachyon','<p>pertama kita buka ppp -&gt; lalu masuk ke interface, nah disana kita melihat ada vpn yang mengarah ke cloud yaitu ada KR3TOCLOUD dan LT2P-TOCLOUD</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790820941_image.png\" style=\"width: 727.945px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p>lalu setelah itu kita buka kedua vpn itu dita cek dialoutnya ke arah ip mana</p><p><br></p><p>ini untuk&nbsp; LT2P-TOCLOUD conect to&nbsp;149.129.233.137</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790821091_image.png\" style=\"width: 492.984px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>ini untuk&nbsp; KR3TOCLOUD conect to 8.215.48.238</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790821236_image.png\" style=\"width: 494.977px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>setelah itu masuk kemenu routing kita search ip nya tersebut lalu kita alihkan ke tachyon</p><p>8.215.48.238&nbsp; &nbsp; (KR3TOCLOUD)</p><p>149.129.233.137 (LT2P-TOCLOUD)</p><p>gambar dibawah ke disable karena isp ifortenya sudah aman</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790821420_image.png\" style=\"width: 720.984px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790821479_image.png\" style=\"width: 705.984px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p>oke jika sudah lalu masuk lagi ke menu interface -&gt; ppp, lalu vpn yang ke arak cloud tadi di disable enable agar tidak nyangkut koneksinya</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790821547_image.png\" style=\"width: 744.984px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>selanjutnya untuk verifikasi kita traceroute ke arah ip yang mengarah ke cloudnya apakah sudah sesuai jalurnya menggunakan isp tachyon</p><p>8.215.48.238&nbsp; &nbsp; (KR3TOCLOUD)</p><p>149.129.233.137 (LT2P-TOCLOUD)</p><p><br></p><p>contoh gambar dibawah mengarah ke isp iforte karna isp ifortenya masih aman</p><p><img src=\"uploads/1790821733_image.png\" style=\"width: 687.961px;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,1),(93,'2026-10-06 01:26:09','Tugas-pagi','login dan password wazuh','login dan password wazuh','<p><a href=\"https://172.16.70.68:8642/\" target=\"_blank\">https://172.16.70.68:8642/</a></p><p>user : admin</p><p>password:&nbsp;M6OxhxhOoYTfJj5sUouB</p>',NULL,1),(94,'2026-10-06 01:27:37','Tugas-pagi','AKSES DATABASE DAN APLIKASI BI','AKSES DATABASE DAN APLIKASI BI','<p>server</p><p>ip: 172.16.70.17</p><p>user: root</p><p>pass: simgroup*&^</p><p>port: 35827</p><p><br></p><p>database</p><p>ip: 172.16.70.17</p><p>por: 13306</p><p>user: sysbprbicara_app</p><p>password: A711aDXfRdsnAM86xUByKYo77yE71jK68ZLu8znoKEU</p><p><br></p><p>akses aplikasi</p><p><a href=\"https://coreopsbicara.simgroup.co.id/login\" target=\"_blank\">https://coreopsbicara.simgroup.co.id/login</a></p><p>user : coreops-admin</p><p>password: LG_1aN898LatIjQ-77LcpTdqJ23BFDa9</p>',NULL,1),(95,'2026-10-06 01:33:32','Security','PASS PENTING','PASS PENTING','<p>8.215.81.108</p><p>QNAP : 172.16.29.69 , ngadmin ,<br>\r\ncxyuV7VC8XV5a59VOxl9</p><p>portainer: untuk memonitoring container di server 70.81 sistem-bi<br>\r\n172.16.70.81:9000<br>\r\nadmin<br>\r\nEDZrir+y@\"8I</p><p>pass keepass: h4b1sg3l4pt3rb1tl4ht3r4ng</p><p>Akses OSS<br>\r\nacc